
# game/a1s5.rpy:3
translate spanish a1s5_ace5452e:

    # "I dream a lot the night before the first trial."
    "Sueño mucho la noche anterior a la primera prueba."

# game/a1s5.rpy:4
translate spanish a1s5_bb50a2bd:

    # "I can't remember most of it, but in the last bit I'm in the throne room, surrounded by dozens of wolves who I assume they're the triumvirates."
    "No recuerdo la mayor parte, pero en el último tramo estoy en la sala del trono, rodeado de decenas de lobos que supongo que son los triunviros."

# game/a1s5.rpy:5
translate spanish a1s5_21d70717:

    # "Cato sits on the throne, watching over all of us, his chin on a fist."
    "Cato está sentado en el trono, observándonos a todos con la barbilla apoyada en un puño."

# game/a1s5.rpy:6
translate spanish a1s5_e1031103:

    # "Meanwhile, Amicus is in the center, doing some type of breakdance."
    "Mientras tanto, Amicus está en el centro, haciendo una especie de breakdance."

# game/a1s5.rpy:7
translate spanish a1s5_db69c1b2:

    # "He's athletic and light on his feet before throwing off his cape and doing a handstand."
    "Se mueve con agilidad y ligereza antes de quitarse la capa y hacer el pino."

# game/a1s5.rpy:8
translate spanish a1s5_c275c0b3:

    # "Then he spins on his head for a while as the wolves around him cheer."
    "Después gira sobre la cabeza un rato mientras los lobos a su alrededor lo animan."

# game/a1s5.rpy:9
translate spanish a1s5_8d99cf67:

    # "Even Cato claps reluctantly."
    "Incluso Cato aplaude a regañadientes."

# game/a1s5.rpy:10
translate spanish a1s5_263bd92e:

    # "Meanwhile, Cassius has his paw to his mouth, realizing that he's been beaten, his paper bones incapable of withstanding such incredible moves."
    "Mientras tanto, Cassius tiene una pata en la boca, comprendiendo que está derrotado, con sus huesos de papel incapaces de soportar movimientos tan increíbles."

# game/a1s5.rpy:11
translate spanish a1s5_73b63a1b:

    # "Then I wake up."
    "Entonces me despierto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:13
translate spanish a1s5_5adeb5a7:

    # "I open my eyes and see the dark outline of the ceiling above me, the lights automatically coming on to a dim, yellow glow."
    "Abro los ojos y veo el oscuro contorno del techo; las luces se encienden automáticamente con un tenue resplandor amarillo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:14
translate spanish a1s5_0a88b595:

    # "I hear Amicus's soft snoring next to me and look over, seeing that he's flat on his back, mouth open and hugging one of his many pillows to his chest."
    "Oigo los suaves ronquidos de Amicus a mi lado y miro hacia él; está boca arriba, con la boca abierta y una de sus muchas almohadas abrazada al pecho."

# game/a1s5.rpy:15
translate spanish a1s5_34c00563:

    # "I roll onto my back, feeling the anxiety of the upcoming trial return."
    "Me pongo boca arriba, sintiendo volver la ansiedad por la próxima prueba."

# game/a1s5.rpy:16
translate spanish a1s5_6cb797ec:

    # "After a while, I whisper up at the ceiling."
    "Al cabo de un rato, susurro hacia el techo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:17
translate spanish a1s5_f04abe25:

    # m "\"Com, what time is it?\""
    m "\"Com, ¿qué hora es?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:18
translate spanish a1s5_15d64ac2:

    # "Com whispers back."
    "Com me responde en un susurro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:19
translate spanish a1s5_e873b6b7:

    # com "\"Half-past the first hour.\""
    com "\"La primera hora y media.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:20
translate spanish a1s5_ffc07cb2:

    # "So I have at least three hours left before I can get up and get ready."
    "Así que me quedan al menos tres horas antes de poder levantarme y prepararme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:21
translate spanish a1s5_3b161562:

    # "I close my eyes to try and get more sleep."
    "Cierro los ojos para intentar dormir más."

# game/a1s5.rpy:22
translate spanish a1s5_9b9610b9:

    # "It's hard though, mainly because my future could be determined today."
    "Pero resulta difícil, principalmente porque mi futuro podría decidirse hoy."

# game/a1s5.rpy:23
translate spanish a1s5_3749fb13:

    # "Amicus told me that we really only need to win this trial to win the whole thing."
    "Amicus me dijo que en realidad solo necesitamos ganar esta prueba para ganarlo todo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:24
translate spanish a1s5_c1fa5495:

    # "Because if we win tomorrow, that means that Cassius will at least have to partake in the combat trial, if not outright lose if we win the second trial."
    "Porque si ganamos mañana, Cassius al menos tendrá que participar en la prueba de combate, si no pierde directamente al ganar nosotros la segunda prueba."

# game/a1s5.rpy:25
translate spanish a1s5_8950aa4a:

    # "And according to Amicus, Cassius has absolutely no chance in {i}pugnu{/i} combat, and he knows that."
    "Y, según Amicus, Cassius no tiene ninguna oportunidad en el combate {i}pugnu{/i}, y lo sabe."

# game/a1s5.rpy:26
translate spanish a1s5_f46d2e07:

    # "While he might still participate in the second trial to save some face, he'd have to withdraw for the third, otherwise face outright humiliation."
    "Aunque quizá participe en la segunda prueba para salvar un poco las apariencias, tendría que retirarse de la tercera o enfrentarse a una humillación absoluta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:27
translate spanish a1s5_455fba13:

    # "So if we win tomorrow, I'm almost guaranteed a way home..."
    "Así que, si ganamos mañana, casi tengo garantizada una forma de volver a casa..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:28
translate spanish a1s5_698428cb:

    # "The thought that this whole fiasco could be over soon brings mixed feelings for me."
    "Pensar que todo este fiasco podría terminar pronto me provoca sentimientos encontrados."

# game/a1s5.rpy:29
translate spanish a1s5_1a955bd9:

    # "While I'm going to go home when I get the chance, I can't help but feel a little sad at the idea of leaving Amicus and the palace."
    "Aunque volveré a casa cuando tenga la oportunidad, no puedo evitar sentirme algo triste al pensar en dejar a Amicus y el palacio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:30
translate spanish a1s5_e9940c89:

    # "We're good friends at this point, and the thought that I might just get dropped off and never see him again..."
    "A estas alturas somos buenos amigos, y pensar que podrían dejarme allí y que nunca volvería a verlo..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:31
translate spanish a1s5_0e4c5cd2:

    # "I sigh and listen to the wolf's rhythmic snores, the sound so soft and gentle that rather than keeping me awake, it starts to lull me back to sleep..."
    "Suspiro y escucho los ronquidos rítmicos del lobo, tan suaves y delicados que, en lugar de mantenerme despierto, empiezan a adormecerme otra vez..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:34
translate spanish a1s5_c915adae:

    # "And again, I find myself floating as that wide, vacuous conscience that seems to bleed over the boundaries of any sort of individuality."
    "Y de nuevo me encuentro flotando como esa consciencia amplia y vacía que parece desbordar los límites de cualquier individualidad."

# game/a1s5.rpy:35
translate spanish a1s5_bd7eafa8:

    # "I don't panic this time."
    "Esta vez no entro en pánico."

# game/a1s5.rpy:36
translate spanish a1s5_ba3d4018:

    # "I'm used to the feeling, knowing that it's just a dream, that it will pass."
    "Estoy acostumbrado a la sensación y sé que solo es un sueño, que pasará."

# game/a1s5.rpy:37
translate spanish a1s5_6e8c233a:

    # "I also sense that other presence above me, even wider than I am."
    "También percibo esa otra presencia sobre mí, aún más extensa que yo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:38
translate spanish a1s5_eb979d57:

    # "They've been following me around since I got on that ship."
    "Me ha estado siguiendo desde que subí a aquella nave."

# game/a1s5.rpy:39
translate spanish a1s5_a735a72f:

    # "Knowing that someone else is there calms me further, and I wait, wondering if they'll talk to me again."
    "Saber que hay alguien más me tranquiliza aún más, y espero, preguntándome si volverá a hablarme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:40
translate spanish a1s5_486ae821:

    # "They do."
    "Lo hace."

# game/a1s5.rpy:41
translate spanish a1s5_c3e02442:

    # "\"I am still curious.\""
    "\"Sigo teniendo curiosidad.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:42
translate spanish a1s5_b3e4c959:

    # "I try to talk back this time, ask them what they're curious about exactly, but I don't have a mouth to speak with."
    "Esta vez intento responder y preguntar qué le provoca tanta curiosidad, pero no tengo una boca con la que hablar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:43
translate spanish a1s5_a9f56f4f:

    # "They seem to hear me though, and in response I sense gentle amusement mixed with..."
    "Sin embargo, parece oírme, y como respuesta siento una leve diversión mezclada con..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:44
translate spanish a1s5_739a7b4b:

    # "Fascination?"
    "¿Fascinación?"

# game/a1s5.rpy:45
translate spanish a1s5_21eb5a76:

    # "\"Many, many things, but once again, I'm afraid I have to keep it short.\""
    "\"Muchas, muchas cosas, pero de nuevo me temo que debo ser breve.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:46
translate spanish a1s5_0df5b9fc:

    # "I wait expectantly."
    "Espero con expectación."

# game/a1s5.rpy:47
translate spanish a1s5_061e27b9:

    # "\"Do you feel that Amicus would be capable of his duties as emperor of Adastra?\""
    "\"¿Crees que Amicus sería capaz de cumplir sus deberes como emperador de Adastra?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:52
translate spanish a1s5_816f20ad:

    # "\"Ah, how...interesting.\""
    "\"Ah, qué...interesante.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:55
translate spanish a1s5_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:58
translate spanish a1s5_d7676c1e:

    # "\"I see...perhaps you need more time. There is still much, much more to learn.\""
    "\"Ya veo...quizá necesitas más tiempo. Todavía queda muchísimo por aprender.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:60
translate spanish a1s5_8176c70e:

    # "The presence above me starts to dissipate, and so do I."
    "La presencia sobre mí empieza a disiparse, y yo también."

# game/a1s5.rpy:63
translate spanish a1s5_8d5c2ec6:

    # "I'm standing awkwardly in the bathroom while another wolf moves busily around me, making short, clipped comments about my odd shape and tiny stature."
    "Estoy de pie incómodo en el baño mientras otro lobo se mueve atareado a mi alrededor, haciendo comentarios breves y secos sobre mi forma extraña y mi diminuta estatura."

# game/a1s5.rpy:64
translate spanish a1s5_721a66a9:

    # "He's the first wolf I've seen that isn't part of the imperial family, so I keep trying not to stare at him while he turns my head left and right, smudging a black substance on my face while he does."
    "Es el primer lobo que veo que no pertenece a la familia imperial, así que intento no mirarlo fijamente mientras me gira la cabeza de un lado a otro y me unta una sustancia negra en la cara."

# game/a1s5.rpy:66
translate spanish a1s5_5be76f51:

    # "Meanwhile, Amicus stands behind us, his face showing a mixture of amusement and concern."
    "Mientras tanto, Amicus está detrás, con una mezcla de diversión y preocupación en el rostro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:67
translate spanish a1s5_7a37b0cd:

    # "I raise an eyebrow at him through the mirror, but he just shrugs in response."
    "Lo miro con una ceja alzada a través del espejo, pero él solo responde encogiéndose de hombros."

# game/a1s5.rpy:68
translate spanish a1s5_5a9fcb63:

    # "Old Wolf" "\"Do not move your...face, please.\""
    "Old Wolf" "\"No muevas la...cara, por favor.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:69
translate spanish a1s5_50a5b051:

    # "I look straight ahead again, letting him smudge the black makeup on my face, still trying not to stare."
    "Vuelvo a mirar al frente, dejando que me extienda el maquillaje negro por la cara y aún intentando no mirarlo fijamente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:70
translate spanish a1s5_d87e9324:

    # "He's hunched and droopy, wearing some type of monocle with flashing lights."
    "Es encorvado y flácido, y lleva una especie de monóculo con luces intermitentes."

# game/a1s5.rpy:71
translate spanish a1s5_5ab2f777:

    # "The lens sticks out every now and then with a mechanical droning sound as he examines his work."
    "La lente se extiende de vez en cuando con un zumbido mecánico mientras examina su trabajo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:72
translate spanish a1s5_e78a717d:

    # "Also, I'm in a dress."
    "Además, llevo un vestido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:73
translate spanish a1s5_aed67eeb:

    # "There's no getting around it; I'm in a blue, tight-fitting gown that's covered in intricate, gold designs."
    "No hay otra forma de decirlo: llevo un vestido azul ajustado, cubierto de complejos diseños dorados."

# game/a1s5.rpy:74
translate spanish a1s5_a8bcffd7:

    # "It's beautiful, no doubt, but I'm not really one for dresses, and I feel my face heating up with embarrassment every time I look into the mirror."
    "Es hermoso, sin duda, pero los vestidos no son lo mío, y noto que me arde la cara de vergüenza cada vez que miro el espejo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:75
translate spanish a1s5_cd53d8b1:

    # "So instead, I focus on staring at the wall or Amicus."
    "Así que me concentro en mirar la pared o a Amicus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:76
translate spanish a1s5_1900ea00:

    # m "\"So why aren't {i}you{/i} getting dressed up?\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿por qué {i}tú{/i} no te vistes de gala?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:77
translate spanish a1s5_e4f84564:

    # "Old Wolf" "\"Do not speak, please.\""
    "Old Wolf" "\"No hables, por favor.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:79
translate spanish a1s5_e74d22f9:

    # a "\"Me? Well, I'm already dressed the part of the emperor!\""
    a "\"¿Yo? ¡Bueno, ya estoy vestido como corresponde al emperador!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:81
translate spanish a1s5_21c5216e:

    # "Amicus fans out his cape with both paws."
    "Amicus despliega su capa con ambas patas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:82
translate spanish a1s5_52299d2a:

    # "I start to roll my eyes, but stop myself before the wolf can yell at me again."
    "Empiezo a poner los ojos en blanco, pero me detengo antes de que el lobo vuelva a gritarme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:83
translate spanish a1s5_f032b645:

    # "I realize that he's painting black stripes on my face, and it immediately reminds me of tiger stripes."
    "Me doy cuenta de que me está pintando rayas negras en la cara, y enseguida me recuerdan las rayas de un tigre."

# game/a1s5.rpy:84
translate spanish a1s5_e8917425:

    # "After that's done, he does the same to the exposed parts of my arms."
    "Cuando termina, hace lo mismo en las partes descubiertas de mis brazos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:85
translate spanish a1s5_23bce18c:

    # "Old Wolf" "\"Remember not to touch or itch at your face. Also, keep your arms away from your body unless you want to ruin the fabric with powder.\""
    "Old Wolf" "\"Recuerda no tocarte ni rascarte la cara. Y mantén los brazos apartados del cuerpo, a menos que quieras arruinar la tela con el polvo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:86
translate spanish a1s5_ec796712:

    # "The wolf finally steps back, giving a snort of approval before turning and stuffing his equipment into his bag."
    "El lobo por fin retrocede, resopla con aprobación y luego se vuelve para meter su equipo en la bolsa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:88
translate spanish a1s5_38471715:

    # a "\"Thank you.\""
    a "\"Gracias.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:89
translate spanish a1s5_2408fa65:

    # "Old Wolf" "\"You're welcome.\""
    "Old Wolf" "\"De nada.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:90
translate spanish a1s5_3c1a5d51:

    # "And with that, the old wolf hurries out of the bathroom, leaving the two of us alone."
    "Y con eso el viejo lobo sale deprisa del baño, dejándonos solos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:91
translate spanish a1s5_5120eaeb:

    # "I stand there a moment, staring at myself in the mirror, feeling like a circus attraction."
    "Me quedo un momento mirándome al espejo, sintiéndome como una atracción de circo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:92
translate spanish a1s5_e69c9430:

    # m "\"I look...awful.\""
    m "\"Tengo un aspecto...horrible.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:95
translate spanish a1s5_241a1ee4:

    # "Amicus coughs and steps up quickly, resting a paw on my shoulder."
    "Amicus tose y se acerca rápidamente, posándome una pata en el hombro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:97
translate spanish a1s5_98c01a5e:

    # a "\"You look very good, actually. Very elegant.\""
    a "\"De hecho, tienes muy buen aspecto. Muy elegante.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:98
translate spanish a1s5_809f91b2:

    # "I look up at the wolf and see him smiling at me."
    "Alzo la mirada al lobo y veo que me sonríe."

# game/a1s5.rpy:99
translate spanish a1s5_236eac39:

    # "I don't know if he's just trying to make me feel better, but then again, I suppose wolves don't really have any idea of what human beauty standards are."
    "No sé si solo intenta animarme, aunque supongo que los lobos tampoco tienen idea de cuáles son los estándares de belleza humanos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:100
translate spanish a1s5_93d43435:

    # "I look at the black stripes on my face."
    "Miro las rayas negras de mi cara."

# game/a1s5.rpy:101
translate spanish a1s5_f803c8dc:

    # m "\"Are these tiger stripes?\""
    m "\"¿Son rayas de tigre?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:103
translate spanish a1s5_6af1168d:

    # "Amicus raises his eyebrows."
    "Amicus alza las cejas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:104
translate spanish a1s5_372f7dec:

    # a "\"Yes, actually. You have tigers on Earth?\""
    a "\"Sí, de hecho. ¿Tenéis tigres en la Tierra?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:105
translate spanish a1s5_f9f6b268:

    # m "\"Yeah...is this like, okay with them, not offensive? It looks like a joke.\""
    m "\"Sí...¿les parece bien esto, no es ofensivo? Parece una broma.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:107
translate spanish a1s5_eaaba61a:

    # a "\"Offensive? Why would it be offensive? We're honoring Meera with this dance.\""
    a "\"¿Ofensivo? ¿Por qué lo sería? Honramos a Meera con este baile.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:108
translate spanish a1s5_745f0138:

    # m "\"If you're sure...\""
    m "\"Si estás seguro...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:110
translate spanish a1s5_b29f2789:

    # a "\"Of course I'm sure! And you don't look like a joke, you look like a strong, beautiful, Hindo tigress.\""
    a "\"¡Por supuesto que estoy seguro! Y no pareces una broma: pareces una tigresa Hindo fuerte y hermosa.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:111
translate spanish a1s5_22c545b4:

    # "I sigh again, still awkwardly holding my arms away from the dress, feeling stiff."
    "Vuelvo a suspirar, todavía apartando incómodamente los brazos del vestido y sintiéndome rígido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:112
translate spanish a1s5_4fe86f18:

    # m "\"When does this all start?\""
    m "\"¿Cuándo empieza todo esto?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:114
translate spanish a1s5_3095316f:

    # a "\"Well, for ME in about twenty minutes, but for you, another hour or so.\""
    a "\"Bueno, para MÍ dentro de unos veinte minutos, pero para ti, dentro de una hora más o menos.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:115
translate spanish a1s5_ff1c32bc:

    # m "\"Alright, anything I should expect before it starts?\""
    m "\"Vale, ¿algo que deba esperar antes de que empiece?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:116
translate spanish a1s5_0d7de5e0:

    # a "\"Not much, the triumvirates will be watching through video link, so only Cato will be there to judge.\""
    a "\"No mucha gente; los triunviros observarán por videoconferencia, así que solo Cato estará allí para juzgar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:117
translate spanish a1s5_2d6ee573:

    # m "\"Oh.\""
    m "\"Ah.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:118
translate spanish a1s5_4711f397:

    # a "\"Keep in mind that it will all be televised live to the rest of Adastra, so...\""
    a "\"Ten en cuenta que se televisará todo en directo al resto de Adastra, así que...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:119
translate spanish a1s5_049e1c4f:

    # "Amicus sees the look on my face."
    "Amicus ve mi expresión."

# game/a1s5.rpy:121
translate spanish a1s5_7831d1eb:

    # a "\"Erm...maybe I shouldn't have told you that?\""
    a "\"Eh...¿quizá no debería habértelo dicho?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:122
translate spanish a1s5_12cf47ec:

    # m "\"ALL of Adastra? LIVE!?\""
    m "\"¿¡TODA Adastra!? ¿¡EN DIRECTO!?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:123
translate spanish a1s5_fa8a3b03:

    # a "\"Don't worry! No one will actually be there in person, so just...pretend, I guess.\""
    a "\"¡No te preocupes! Nadie estará allí en persona, así que...finge, supongo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:124
translate spanish a1s5_034822bb:

    # m "\"Why DID you just tell me that?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué me lo acabas de decir?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:126
translate spanish a1s5_8a9e2875:

    # a "\"Well, I had planned on you watching the first half of the trial in the dining room. You'll know how everything is going until it's your turn.\""
    a "\"Bueno, había planeado que vieras la primera mitad de la prueba en el comedor. Sabrás cómo va todo hasta que te toque.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:127
translate spanish a1s5_411e2a61:

    # "I swallow hard."
    "Trago saliva con dificultad."

# game/a1s5.rpy:129
translate spanish a1s5_3cd18dd3:

    # a "\"I didn't mean to keep that from you, I just thought you might know this would be the case...the entire moon pays very close attention to these trials.\""
    a "\"No pretendía ocultártelo; simplemente pensé que quizá sabrías que sería así...toda la luna presta mucha atención a estas pruebas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:130
translate spanish a1s5_3d810a2f:

    # "He's right, I guess I sort of did assume that would be the case, but now that it's actually happening..."
    "Tiene razón; supongo que lo había dado por hecho, pero ahora que está ocurriendo..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:131
translate spanish a1s5_77f32cc4:

    # "I feel like I'm gonna pass out."
    "Siento que voy a desmayarme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:132
translate spanish a1s5_932ffe3a:

    # "Maybe I'll get lucky and it'll happen when Meera dies during the dance."
    "Quizá tenga suerte y ocurra cuando Meera muere durante el baile."

# game/a1s5.rpy:134
translate spanish a1s5_a1eebe62:

    # a "\"Listen, you'll be fine. We'll win this and before you know it, I'll be emperor and our problems will be over.\""
    a "\"Escucha, estarás bien. Ganaremos esto y, antes de que te des cuenta, seré emperador y nuestros problemas se habrán acabado.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:135
translate spanish a1s5_de01aecf:

    # "Again, the idea of having my way home all but guaranteed in the next hour..."
    "De nuevo, la idea de tener prácticamente garantizado el regreso a casa dentro de una hora..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:136
translate spanish a1s5_9e0eb29a:

    # "It reminds me of the thoughts I'd had last night."
    "Me recuerda lo que pensaba anoche."

# game/a1s5.rpy:137
translate spanish a1s5_663cd1b2:

    # m "\"So, uh, when I do get home, is that gonna be the last time I'll see you?\""
    m "\"Entonces, eh, cuando vuelva a casa, ¿será la última vez que te vea?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:139
translate spanish a1s5_9f834575:

    # "The corners of Amicus's mouth twitch down in a frown, but only for a moment before he smiles again."
    "Las comisuras de Amicus bajan en un gesto de tristeza, pero solo un momento antes de que vuelva a sonreír."

# game/a1s5.rpy:141
translate spanish a1s5_293c1241:

    # a "\"Well, I suppose that's up to you. With unlimited access to the stretch, I might be able to make visits every now and then. Would you like that?\""
    a "\"Bueno, supongo que depende de ti. Con acceso ilimitado a la Propulsión, quizá pueda visitarte de vez en cuando. ¿Te gustaría?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:142
translate spanish a1s5_e25826cf:

    # "I don't even have to think about it."
    "Ni siquiera tengo que pensarlo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:143
translate spanish a1s5_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Sí.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:145
translate spanish a1s5_71643afe:

    # "Amicus's smile widens."
    "La sonrisa de Amicus se ensancha."

# game/a1s5.rpy:146
translate spanish a1s5_b5d3b8fa:

    # a "\"I would as well.\""
    a "\"A mí también me gustaría.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:147
translate spanish a1s5_e1510eba:

    # m "\"Yeah, I mean, you're my friend, and I'd wanna hear about the results of your empire.\""
    m "\"Sí, quiero decir, eres mi amigo, y querría saber cómo va tu imperio.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:149
translate spanish a1s5_3a2a4472:

    # "But then Amicus's smile falters, then turns into a frown."
    "Pero entonces la sonrisa de Amicus vacila y se convierte en un gesto de preocupación."

# game/a1s5.rpy:150
translate spanish a1s5_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:151
translate spanish a1s5_11ef72f6:

    # "The wolf is quiet for a moment, then his ears flatten."
    "El lobo calla un momento y luego aplasta las orejas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:152
translate spanish a1s5_c4d62fec:

    # a "\"I er...forgot the reason you're here in the first place.\""
    a "\"Yo, eh...olvidé la razón por la que estás aquí.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:153
translate spanish a1s5_085c673b:

    # "For a moment, I don't know what he's talking about...then I do."
    "Por un momento no sé a qué se refiere...y luego lo comprendo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:154
translate spanish a1s5_c96f7514:

    # "We're not even supposed to know each other exists."
    "Ni siquiera se supone que sepamos que el otro existe."

# game/a1s5.rpy:155
translate spanish a1s5_8649f18a:

    # "This whole thing is against the law."
    "Todo esto es ilegal."

# game/a1s5.rpy:156
translate spanish a1s5_4574f78d:

    # m "\"Oh...so I guess we wouldn't be able to do that, huh?\""
    m "\"Oh...así que supongo que no podríamos hacerlo, ¿no?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:157
translate spanish a1s5_7e2614ca:

    # "Amicus bites his lip, then shakes his head."
    "Amicus se muerde el labio y luego niega con la cabeza."

# game/a1s5.rpy:159
translate spanish a1s5_d7f884bb:

    # a "\"We'll figure it out, but now is not the time for that. We have a trial to win!\""
    a "\"Lo resolveremos, pero ahora no es momento para eso. ¡Tenemos una prueba que ganar!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:161
translate spanish a1s5_9e75dbd1:

    # "Amicus turns to me and, after a little hesitation, pulls me into a quick side hug, carefully avoiding the black powder on my arm."
    "Amicus se vuelve hacia mí y, tras vacilar un poco, me da un rápido abrazo de lado, evitando con cuidado el polvo negro de mi brazo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:162
translate spanish a1s5_3fccf4a0:

    # a "\"We'll talk more afterwards over a celebratory dinner, alright?\""
    a "\"Hablaremos más después, durante una cena de celebración, ¿de acuerdo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:163
translate spanish a1s5_e15aa213:

    # "The absolute confidence and reassurance in Amicus's voice calms me just a little, and I manage a small smile."
    "La seguridad y la confianza absolutas en la voz de Amicus me tranquilizan un poco, y consigo esbozar una pequeña sonrisa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:164
translate spanish a1s5_b59cb80e:

    # m "\"Alright...\""
    m "\"De acuerdo...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:166
translate spanish a1s5_1891a5b1:

    # a "\"Good! And a, uh...little more celebration after that, if you get my meaning.\""
    a "\"¡Bien! Y, eh...un poco más de celebración después, si entiendes a qué me refiero.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:167
translate spanish a1s5_8ae59e05:

    # "I had almost forgotten about THAT."
    "Casi me había olvidado de ESO."

# game/a1s5.rpy:168
translate spanish a1s5_6ae30550:

    # m "\"Amicus...\""
    m "\"Amicus...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:170
translate spanish a1s5_4a353335:

    # a "\"If you want, if you want...\""
    a "\"Si quieres, si quieres...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:172
translate spanish a1s5_f37fd95b:

    # "Amicus chuckles before his ears perk up, his personal Com talking to him in a quiet, babbling sound."
    "Amicus se ríe antes de levantar las orejas; su Com personal le habla en un suave sonido balbuceante."

# game/a1s5.rpy:173
translate spanish a1s5_582207b4:

    # a "\"Alright, that's my cue. Head to the dining room if you'd like to watch. Otherwise, Com will tell you when to leave for the throne room, alright?\""
    a "\"Bien, esa es mi señal. Ve al comedor si quieres verlo. Si no, Com te dirá cuándo salir hacia la sala del trono, ¿de acuerdo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:174
translate spanish a1s5_61f1b4ab:

    # "I nod, and Amicus gives me one last pat on the shoulder before turning away."
    "Asiento, y Amicus me da una última palmada en el hombro antes de volverse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:175
translate spanish a1s5_415e6b17:

    # m "\"Um, good luck. I know you're gonna do great.\""
    m "\"Eh, buena suerte. Sé que lo harás genial.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:178
translate spanish a1s5_468074b0:

    # "Amicus waves at me before walking out the door, leaving me alone to wait."
    "Amicus me saluda con la pata antes de salir por la puerta, dejándome solo esperando."

# game/a1s5.rpy:180
translate spanish a1s5_2b1f563d:

    # "I move to the bed and sit down, carefully resting my arms out to the side, wishing that they'd applied the makeup a little closer to the dance so I didn't have to walk around like a scarecrow."
    "Me acerco a la cama y me siento, apoyando los brazos con cuidado a los lados; ojalá me hubieran maquillado más cerca de la hora del baile para no tener que andar como un espantapájaros."

# game/a1s5.rpy:181
translate spanish a1s5_8049bbf2:

    # "I realize pretty quickly that sitting here in silence is only making me more nervous, so I slowly get up, making my way to the main hall."
    "Enseguida comprendo que sentarme aquí en silencio solo me pone más nervioso, así que me levanto despacio y voy al pasillo principal."

# game/a1s5.rpy:184
translate spanish a1s5_9ba38874:

    # "As usual, the halls are empty."
    "Como siempre, los pasillos están vacíos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:185
translate spanish a1s5_8f5fe9ba:

    # "The only people living here are the imperial siblings, Cato, and Neferu."
    "Las únicas personas que viven aquí son los hermanos de la familia imperial, Cato y Neferu."

# game/a1s5.rpy:186
translate spanish a1s5_bf67599a:

    # "The old makeup wolf is the only other person that I've seen over the past two and a half weeks that I've been here."
    "El viejo lobo maquillador es la única otra persona que he visto en las dos semanas y media que llevo aquí."

# game/a1s5.rpy:187
translate spanish a1s5_1f359ea8:

    # "It makes me think that I still want to see the city before I leave...if I leave."
    "Eso me hace pensar que todavía quiero ver la ciudad antes de irme...si me voy."

# game/a1s5.rpy:188
translate spanish a1s5_20028f8d:

    # "I block that thought from my brain, trying not to think of what might happen if these trials go poorly for us."
    "Aparto ese pensamiento, intentando no pensar en lo que podría pasar si estas pruebas nos salen mal."

# game/a1s5.rpy:189
translate spanish a1s5_d5c4e7f3:

    # "Instead, I try to let the bright sunshine and fresh morning air calm my nerves."
    "En cambio, intento que la brillante luz del sol y el fresco aire matutino me calmen."

# game/a1s5.rpy:192
translate spanish a1s5_b12deb5e:

    # "Eventually, I make my way to the dining room and when I look in, I see Alex sitting on one of the beds."
    "Finalmente llego al comedor y, al mirar dentro, veo a Alex sentado en uno de los lechos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:195
translate spanish a1s5_edcb37d6:

    # "His ears perk up as he sees me, eyes widening in surprise."
    "Sus orejas se levantan al verme y sus ojos se abren de sorpresa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:196
translate spanish a1s5_aa3f0962:

    # al "\"Oh! Hello, [mc]...how are you?\""
    al "\"¡Oh! Hola, [mc]...¿cómo estás?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:197
translate spanish a1s5_869abc8e:

    # "He stares at my face, then down at my costume."
    "Me mira la cara y luego baja la vista a mi disfraz."

# game/a1s5.rpy:198
translate spanish a1s5_7acf5d9b:

    # "I feel myself turning red and I desperately wish that I had stayed in Amicus's room."
    "Noto que me pongo rojo y deseo desesperadamente haberme quedado en la habitación de Amicus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:199
translate spanish a1s5_bec49706:

    # "I'm able to swallow the embarrassment down for now, though."
    "Pero por ahora consigo tragarme la vergüenza."

# game/a1s5.rpy:200
translate spanish a1s5_3ced489e:

    # "I know Alex pretty well, after all."
    "Después de todo, conozco bastante bien a Alex."

# game/a1s5.rpy:201
translate spanish a1s5_9e56b595:

    # m "\"Where's {i}your{/i} costume?\""
    m "\"¿Dónde está {i}tu{/i} disfraz?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:202
translate spanish a1s5_a5039f4a:

    # "At this point I feel like I'm the only person being made to play dress up."
    "A estas alturas siento que soy el único al que hacen disfrazarse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:203
translate spanish a1s5_8ed9a7ad:

    # "I sit down on the middle bed, not wanting to be directly across from the cat where he'd have to stare at me."
    "Me siento en el lecho del medio; no quiero estar justo enfrente del gato, donde tendría que mirarme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:205
translate spanish a1s5_7c7ca408:

    # al "\"Er, should I be in one?\""
    al "\"Eh, ¿debería llevar uno?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:206
translate spanish a1s5_8619f2c6:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/a1s5.rpy:207
translate spanish a1s5_6cc2453e:

    # m "\"I don't know, they put me in one, obviously.\""
    m "\"No sé, a mí me han puesto uno, evidentemente.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:209
translate spanish a1s5_eb76323a:

    # al "\"Obviously...and the powder, too.\""
    al "\"Evidentemente...y el polvo también.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:210
translate spanish a1s5_282940ac:

    # "I glare at Alex."
    "Fulmino a Alex con la mirada."

# game/a1s5.rpy:212
translate spanish a1s5_a143b657:

    # al "\"I mean, you look good, very bold.\""
    al "\"Quiero decir, tienes buen aspecto, muy atrevido.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:213
translate spanish a1s5_13eb20aa:

    # m "\"So why the hell aren't you dressed up as Meera? We're doing the same dance, right?\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿por qué demonios no vas vestido de Meera? Hacemos el mismo baile, ¿no?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:215
translate spanish a1s5_2eb62d70:

    # al "\"Well, yes, though Cassius instructed that I be in my underwear. Actually, I think I'd prefer your situation.\""
    al "\"Bueno, sí, aunque Cassius me indicó que estuviera en ropa interior. De hecho, creo que preferiría tu situación.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:216
translate spanish a1s5_910f899d:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Claro.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:218
translate spanish a1s5_235913c3:

    # al "\"Seriously! You think I want all of Adastra to see my naked torso?\""
    al "\"¡En serio! ¿Crees que quiero que toda Adastra vea mi torso desnudo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:219
translate spanish a1s5_5cac312c:

    # "Alex hugs himself, shuddering."
    "Alex se abraza a sí mismo, estremeciéndose."

# game/a1s5.rpy:221
translate spanish a1s5_5dc99612:

    # al "\"It's so embarrassing.\""
    al "\"Es tan vergonzoso.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:222
translate spanish a1s5_2857c22b:

    # "I sigh and sit back on the bed, only now noticing that Cassius is on the screen, playing some sort of brass instrument that looks to be vaguely in the shape of a French horn."
    "Suspiro y me reclino en el lecho; solo entonces veo a Cassius en la pantalla, tocando un instrumento de metal que recuerda vagamente a una trompa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:223
translate spanish a1s5_223d507b:

    # "It sounds nothing like one, though."
    "Pero no suena en absoluto como una."

# game/a1s5.rpy:224
translate spanish a1s5_608dbc8b:

    # "The volume is low, but I can hear the raspy, sputtering sound it's making."
    "El volumen está bajo, pero oigo el sonido áspero y entrecortado que produce."

# game/a1s5.rpy:225
translate spanish a1s5_92577730:

    # "Not pleasant to my ear, but then the idea of what music and dance is seems to very different from Earth."
    "No resulta agradable para mis oídos, pero el concepto de música y danza parece muy distinto al de la Tierra."

# game/a1s5.rpy:226
translate spanish a1s5_ec35379b:

    # m "\"Well, I'd prefer being half-naked. And if this is my introduction to the moon, why am I all covered up like this? I'm pretty sure they'd rather get a better look at what I {i}actually{/i} look like.\""
    m "\"Bueno, yo preferiría estar medio desnudo. Y si así me van a presentar a la luna, ¿por qué estoy tan cubierto? Estoy seguro de que preferirían ver cómo soy {i}realmente{/i}.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:227
translate spanish a1s5_e8b6b494:

    # "But as I'm saying that I wonder if maybe that's WHY Amicus had me so covered up."
    "Pero al decirlo me pregunto si quizá es POR ESO que Amicus me hacía llevar tanta ropa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:229
translate spanish a1s5_c734a6cf:

    # al "\"The dress looks very good actually...it's the makeup that surprises me. I suppose it's very...Wolven to do something like that.\""
    al "\"El vestido te queda muy bien, de hecho...es el maquillaje lo que me sorprende. Supongo que hacer algo así es muy...propio de los lobos.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:230
translate spanish a1s5_98d23ae4:

    # "I look at Alex, frowning."
    "Miro a Alex, frunciendo el ceño."

# game/a1s5.rpy:231
translate spanish a1s5_6fd07c86:

    # m "\"Wolven? Is this offensive?\""
    m "\"¿Propio de los lobos? ¿Es ofensivo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:233
translate spanish a1s5_a6af77fa:

    # al "\"Uhhhh...maybe just a smidge, but not to the wolves, so you have nothing to worry about. The Hindos don't talk to Adastra anymore.\""
    al "\"Ehhh...quizá un poquito, pero no para los lobos, así que no tienes de qué preocuparte. Los Hindos ya no hablan con Adastra.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:234
translate spanish a1s5_a99eb27e:

    # m "\"Oh my god...\""
    m "\"Dios mío...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:235
translate spanish a1s5_a87c28a3:

    # "I want to bury my face in my hands, but I can't with all the make up on."
    "Quiero hundir la cara entre las manos, pero no puedo con todo este maquillaje."

# game/a1s5.rpy:236
translate spanish a1s5_7c5630ee:

    # "On top of that, it's all starting to itch."
    "Además, empieza a picarme todo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:237
translate spanish a1s5_c1c3bbce:

    # m "\"This is so stupid.\""
    m "\"Esto es tan estúpido.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:239
translate spanish a1s5_a22b59f6:

    # "Alex chuckles."
    "Alex se ríe."

# game/a1s5.rpy:240
translate spanish a1s5_1102eba4:

    # al "\"It really is. The Wolves are so obsessed with spectacle and drama which is why the trials are used instead of elections...or even just sound judgment from a council.\""
    al "\"Lo es. Los lobos están tan obsesionados con el espectáculo y el drama que usan pruebas en lugar de elecciones...o incluso del criterio sensato de un consejo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:241
translate spanish a1s5_3e15e2c0:

    # "Alex gestures up at one of the screens."
    "Alex señala una de las pantallas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:243
translate spanish a1s5_2650667f:

    # al "\"It's an Adastran holiday right now so everyone can watch this.\""
    al "\"Hoy es festivo en Adastra para que todos puedan ver esto.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:244
translate spanish a1s5_73337d4d:

    # "Cassius has finished his little song, standing up and bowing."
    "Cassius ha terminado su pequeña canción y se levanta para hacer una reverencia."

# game/a1s5.rpy:245
translate spanish a1s5_f3c87b53:

    # "Along the right edge of the screen, five little boxes pop up, each one containing the faces of three wolves sitting solemnly side-by-side."
    "En el borde derecho de la pantalla aparecen cinco pequeñas ventanas, cada una con los rostros de tres lobos sentados solemnemente uno junto al otro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:246
translate spanish a1s5_26bb3316:

    # al "\"Though, in a way, the people are having a role in choosing their emperor here, with their elected triumvirates making the decision, but then I don't understand why song and dance should apply.\""
    al "\"Aunque, en cierto modo, el pueblo participa en la elección de su emperador, pues sus triunviros electos toman la decisión; pero entonces no entiendo por qué deben contar el canto y el baile.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:247
translate spanish a1s5_ded4b9ed:

    # m "\"So why would Cassius and Amicus campaign if they're just going to be chosen through these trials?\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿por qué hacen campaña Cassius y Amicus si los van a elegir mediante estas pruebas?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:249
translate spanish a1s5_ef6dd3ef:

    # al "\"Wellll...if the decision isn't clear, then why not choose the wolf that has the most popularity with your people? It increases the chance of re-election.\""
    al "\"Bueeeno...si la decisión no está clara, ¿por qué no elegir al lobo más popular entre tu pueblo? Eso aumenta las posibilidades de reelección.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:250
translate spanish a1s5_22387307:

    # "Amicus suddenly appears on screen, sitting down, a spotlight on him as he begins to blow into the same instrument."
    "Amicus aparece de repente en la pantalla y se sienta; un foco lo ilumina mientras empieza a soplar en el mismo instrumento."

# game/a1s5.rpy:251
translate spanish a1s5_dea0c0d9:

    # "Again, that raspy, blatting sound that would make me cringe if it were a human instrument at a human concert."
    "Otra vez ese sonido áspero y estridente que me haría encogerme si fuera un instrumento humano en un concierto humano."

# game/a1s5.rpy:252
translate spanish a1s5_a4cea861:

    # "I have no idea if he's better than Cassius or not."
    "No tengo idea de si lo hace mejor que Cassius."

# game/a1s5.rpy:253
translate spanish a1s5_f823ec67:

    # al "\"And general popularity is good to have anyway. A happy people is usually a more peaceful and easy-to-control society.\""
    al "\"Y, en cualquier caso, tener popularidad general es bueno. Un pueblo feliz suele ser una sociedad más tranquila y fácil de controlar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:254
translate spanish a1s5_45a95942:

    # m "\"So...Amicus is at a disadvantage then?\""
    m "\"Así que...¿Amicus tiene desventaja?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:255
translate spanish a1s5_455490d5:

    # al "\"Unless he clearly outperforms Cassius.\""
    al "\"A menos que lo haga claramente mejor que Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:256
translate spanish a1s5_d18fb977:

    # "I sigh, watching as the wolf's cheeks puff up each time he blows into his little horn, his eyes almost crossed with effort."
    "Suspiro al ver cómo las mejillas del lobo se hinchan cada vez que sopla en su pequeña trompa, casi bizqueando por el esfuerzo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:257
translate spanish a1s5_26a8e4ee:

    # m "\"I guess you elect your officials?\""
    m "\"Supongo que vosotros elegís a vuestros funcionarios.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:259
translate spanish a1s5_8c7583c6:

    # al "\"Yes.\""
    al "\"Sí.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:260
translate spanish a1s5_cab6852f:

    # m "\"So does most of...\""
    m "\"También lo hace la mayor parte de...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:261
translate spanish a1s5_ef07f07d:

    # "I find myself almost saying the name of my planet again."
    "Casi vuelvo a decir el nombre de mi planeta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:262
translate spanish a1s5_1e49b41b:

    # "It's harder and harder to keep this secret from Alex, especially as our relationship has become more casual."
    "Cada vez cuesta más ocultarle este secreto a Alex, especialmente ahora que nuestra relación es más informal."

# game/a1s5.rpy:263
translate spanish a1s5_0d92c38f:

    # m "\"...our tribes.\""
    m "\"...nuestras tribus.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:264
translate spanish a1s5_834b65e8:

    # "At least I think that's what they are on the Simian planet."
    "Al menos creo que eso es lo que hay en el planeta de los Simios."

# game/a1s5.rpy:265
translate spanish a1s5_51a17e63:

    # "I just have to hope that Alex doesn't actually look it up."
    "Solo me queda esperar que Alex no lo investigue."

# game/a1s5.rpy:266
translate spanish a1s5_139dc371:

    # "But he continues on like he didn't notice my pause, like he always does."
    "Pero él continúa como si no hubiera notado mi pausa, como siempre."

# game/a1s5.rpy:267
translate spanish a1s5_a9d03b3a:

    # al "\"Anyway, despite the competition, I still consider you a friend and I hope you feel the same. Maybe we can have lunch in the gardens soon, no matter the result?\""
    al "\"En fin, a pesar de la competición, todavía te considero un amigo y espero que sientas lo mismo. ¿Quizá podemos almorzar pronto en los jardines, sea cual sea el resultado?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:268
translate spanish a1s5_0180db68:

    # m "\"Yeah, let's do that.\""
    m "\"Sí, hagámoslo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:270
translate spanish a1s5_315d3ba8:

    # al "\"Wonderful.\""
    al "\"Maravilloso.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:271
translate spanish a1s5_19df07f7:

    # "We sit in silence for another ten or so minutes, watching as Amicus finishes his horn-playing."
    "Permanecemos en silencio otros diez minutos más o menos, viendo cómo Amicus termina de tocar la trompa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:272
translate spanish a1s5_3e8cc4a8:

    # "Then Cassius takes the spotlight again to begin \"singing\"."
    "Entonces Cassius vuelve a ocupar el centro de atención para empezar a \"cantar\"."

# game/a1s5.rpy:273
translate spanish a1s5_cd424eea:

    # "It's actually just howling, Cass's head leaned back, muzzle tipped toward the ceiling, looking just like a wolf on Earth as it howls to the moon."
    "En realidad, solo son aullidos: Cass tiene la cabeza hacia atrás y el hocico alzado al techo, como un lobo de la Tierra aullando a la luna."

# game/a1s5.rpy:274
translate spanish a1s5_1593ccc6:

    # "I think he's saying words, but I can't really understand, especially with the odd, high pitched tone it has."
    "Creo que dice palabras, pero no las entiendo, especialmente con ese tono extraño y agudo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:275
translate spanish a1s5_609c84c2:

    # "Meanwhile, a little gauge pops up in the bottom screen, a needle going back and forth with the pitch of the howl."
    "Mientras tanto, aparece un pequeño indicador abajo en la pantalla, con una aguja que oscila según el tono del aullido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:276
translate spanish a1s5_c7ff7a17:

    # al "\"They want that indicator to stay in the middle. It represents better control over their song.\""
    al "\"Quieren que el indicador se mantenga en el centro. Representa un mejor control de su canto.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:277
translate spanish a1s5_c8304af6:

    # "It's short, only few minutes before it's Amicus's turn, doing much the same as Cassius except his howl is deeper, fuller—"
    "Es breve, solo unos minutos antes de que le toque a Amicus; hace lo mismo que Cassius, pero su aullido es más profundo y pleno—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:278
translate spanish a1s5_0d0d6b9f:

    # "—a lot better, I think."
    "—mucho mejor, creo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:279
translate spanish a1s5_7ecb64bc:

    # "I also like to think that the needle stays in the middle more often than it had for Cassius, but I'm not sure."
    "También quiero pensar que la aguja permanece en el centro más a menudo que con Cassius, pero no estoy seguro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:280
translate spanish a1s5_a5a7413e:

    # "Toward the end of Amicus's song, Com's voice crackles gently over our heads."
    "Hacia el final de la canción de Amicus, la voz de Com suena suavemente sobre nuestras cabezas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:283
translate spanish a1s5_c87e0e34:

    # com "\"Alex, [mc], the dance begins in five minutes. Please proceed to the throne room doors.\""
    com "\"Alex, [mc], el baile empieza en cinco minutos. Dirigíos a las puertas de la sala del trono, por favor.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:284
translate spanish a1s5_9e4f6441:

    # "My heart skips a beat as we both stand up, Alex leading the way to the hall."
    "Mi corazón se salta un latido cuando nos levantamos y Alex encabeza el camino al pasillo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:286
translate spanish a1s5_18ceb7d7:

    # "I wonder if he's nervous too."
    "Me pregunto si él también está nervioso."

# game/a1s5.rpy:287
translate spanish a1s5_4211cada:

    # "Even though he looks calm, his tail lashes back and forth as we walk."
    "Aunque parece tranquilo, su cola se agita de un lado a otro mientras caminamos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:288
translate spanish a1s5_fb88936e:

    # "I don't try to talk to him, feeling like we're both a little preoccupied with our own thoughts right now."
    "No intento hablarle; siento que ambos estamos algo ocupados con nuestros pensamientos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:289
translate spanish a1s5_e0513ba7:

    # "We get to the big double doors and wait side-by-side."
    "Llegamos a las grandes puertas dobles y esperamos uno junto al otro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:290
translate spanish a1s5_4372c1f8:

    # "Alex's paws are folded neatly in front of himself, so I do the same."
    "Alex tiene las patas cruzadas ordenadamente delante, así que hago lo mismo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:291
translate spanish a1s5_d22bda91:

    # "I try to breathe evenly."
    "Intento respirar de forma regular."

# game/a1s5.rpy:292
translate spanish a1s5_a3c47e34:

    # "I've never been good in front of big crowds and, even though it's technically only Cato in there, I can't forget the fact that millions of people are going to be watching."
    "Nunca se me ha dado bien estar ante grandes multitudes y, aunque técnicamente solo está Cato dentro, no puedo olvidar que millones de personas van a mirar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:293
translate spanish a1s5_95e89882:

    # com "\"Dance trial begins in five, four, three, two...\""
    com "\"La prueba de danza comienza en cinco, cuatro, tres, dos...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:296
translate spanish a1s5_e6b5f81d:

    # "The doors slide open and I find myself staring into a darkened throne room, the windows deeply tinted so that only a vague hint of sunlight comes through."
    "Las puertas se deslizan y me encuentro mirando una sala del trono oscurecida, con las ventanas tan tintadas que solo dejan pasar un vago rastro de luz solar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:297
translate spanish a1s5_22df4225:

    # "I immediately see Amicus straight ahead of me, bathed in a bright spotlight."
    "Enseguida veo a Amicus justo frente a mí, bañado por un foco brillante."

# game/a1s5.rpy:298
translate spanish a1s5_57e3ad27:

    # "The same can be said for Cassius, about ten meters to his right."
    "Lo mismo ocurre con Cassius, a unos diez metros a su derecha."

# game/a1s5.rpy:299
translate spanish a1s5_2c74b0d7:

    # "Cato sits on the throne, just like in my dream."
    "Cato está sentado en el trono, igual que en mi sueño."

# game/a1s5.rpy:300
translate spanish a1s5_27e602b1:

    # "I also notice Virginia and Neferu sitting next to each other on one of the benches."
    "También veo a Virginia y Neferu sentados juntos en uno de los bancos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:301
translate spanish a1s5_9eb819f2:

    # "That alone makes me even more nervous, but then a voice comes over the PA."
    "Eso por sí solo me pone aún más nervioso, pero entonces una voz suena por la megafonía."

# game/a1s5.rpy:302
translate spanish a1s5_ee824575:

    # "Not Com, but someone else, sounding old and frail."
    "No es Com, sino otra persona, de voz anciana y débil."

# game/a1s5.rpy:303
translate spanish a1s5_3111f80b:

    # "Wolf" "\"Presenting Pet Alexios from moon Omorfa, and Pet [mc], from planet Simia.\""
    "Wolf" "\"Presentamos a la mascota Alexios, de la luna Omorfa, y a la mascota [mc], del planeta Simia.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:304
translate spanish a1s5_c19e675d:

    # "Amicus and Cassius reach out one paw, and Alex starts to walk forward on his toes, looking light and sophisticated."
    "Amicus y Cassius extienden una pata, y Alex empieza a avanzar de puntillas, con ligereza y sofisticación."

# game/a1s5.rpy:305
translate spanish a1s5_9947dd8b:

    # "I quickly follow suit, trying to sort of mimic his walk."
    "Lo sigo rápidamente, intentando imitar su forma de andar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:306
translate spanish a1s5_7cc1eebc:

    # "I'd never practiced my entrance with Amicus."
    "Nunca había practicado mi entrada con Amicus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:307
translate spanish a1s5_5a605bee:

    # "I start to wonder if I'm even more under-prepared than I thought I was."
    "Empiezo a preguntarme si estoy aún menos preparado de lo que creía."

# game/a1s5.rpy:308
translate spanish a1s5_c2bf1711:

    # "No time to think about that now."
    "Ahora no hay tiempo para pensar en eso."

# game/a1s5.rpy:309
translate spanish a1s5_5725b9de:

    # "I do the best that I can with my stupid, prancing walk before coming to a stop in front of Amicus, reaching out a hand to rest in his big paw."
    "Hago lo que puedo con mi estúpido andar de pasos saltarines y me detengo frente a Amicus, extendiendo una mano para apoyarla en su gran pata."

# game/a1s5.rpy:311
translate spanish a1s5_54e182e5:

    # "He smiles reassuringly down at me, and for some reason, his presence makes me a little less nervous than I had been while waiting alone for the trial to start."
    "Me sonríe tranquilizadoramente y, por alguna razón, su presencia me pone algo menos nervioso que cuando esperaba solo el comienzo de la prueba."

# game/a1s5.rpy:312
translate spanish a1s5_3a98a344:

    # "We stand there quietly for a moment, but then that old voice starts up again, but now it's in a howl; high, wavering, and faint."
    "Nos quedamos quietos un momento, pero la voz anciana vuelve a empezar, ahora convertida en un aullido agudo, tembloroso y débil."

# game/a1s5.rpy:313
translate spanish a1s5_d363d746:

    # "\"{i}Explorant...adver...viro...{/i}\""
    "\"{i}Explorant...adver...viro...{/i}\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:314
translate spanish a1s5_ac6ccd48:

    # "He starts to recite the story in the same howl, but it's hard to hear, and now that there are words—"
    "Empieza a recitar la historia con ese mismo aullido, pero cuesta oírlo, y ahora que hay palabras—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:315
translate spanish a1s5_b77ee861:

    # "Wait...I can't understand it. He's speaking—"
    "Espera...no lo entiendo. Está hablando—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:317
translate spanish a1s5_0b4564ba:

    # "Oh fuck."
    "Oh, joder."

# game/a1s5.rpy:318
translate spanish a1s5_310cdf3b:

    # "The Lingua isn't translating the song."
    "La Lingua no está traduciendo la canción."

# game/a1s5.rpy:319
translate spanish a1s5_04cd0a46:

    # "Immediately, I start to panic as I see Amicus raise up his paw."
    "Enseguida entro en pánico al ver que Amicus levanta la pata."

# game/a1s5.rpy:321
translate spanish a1s5_6f47940a:

    # "I probably have a look of horror on my face, because his reassuring smile has turned to a frown."
    "Debo de tener una expresión de horror, porque su sonrisa tranquilizadora se ha convertido en preocupación."

# game/a1s5.rpy:322
translate spanish a1s5_032780d8:

    # "Jerkily, I raise up my hand up to touch it to the wolf's paw, trying to stay calm."
    "Levanto la mano a trompicones para tocar la pata del lobo, intentando mantener la calma."

# game/a1s5.rpy:323
translate spanish a1s5_f21effee:

    # "I can do this."
    "Puedo hacerlo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:324
translate spanish a1s5_d525b76d:

    # "Sure, I attached a lot of the movements to the words in the song, but I remember the order of the poses...I think."
    "Sí, asocié muchos movimientos a las palabras de la canción, pero recuerdo el orden de las posturas...creo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:325
translate spanish a1s5_9652a90e:

    # "Still, the unexpected blunder has me flustered and stumbling, my movements hesitant and definitely un-elegant."
    "Aun así, el fallo inesperado me desconcierta y me hace tropezar; mis movimientos son vacilantes y nada elegantes."

# game/a1s5.rpy:326
translate spanish a1s5_8003da0d:

    # "I'm so frazzled that I don't really have time to dwell on the fact that Alex and Cassius are doing the dance at the same time."
    "Estoy tan alterado que ni siquiera tengo tiempo de pensar que Alex y Cassius hacen el baile a la vez."

# game/a1s5.rpy:327
translate spanish a1s5_575273f6:

    # "Are we competing for Cato's and the watching triumvirates' attention?"
    "¿Competimos por la atención de Cato y de los triunviros que nos observan?"

# game/a1s5.rpy:328
translate spanish a1s5_990ac754:

    # "I try to stay focused on Amicus, watching his movements, hoping that I might remember enough of his cues to get through all the movements correctly."
    "Intento concentrarme en Amicus, observando sus movimientos y esperando recordar suficientes indicaciones para completar todo correctamente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:329
translate spanish a1s5_867a6519:

    # "My falling apart must be affecting Amicus as well, his brow furrowed in confusion, his movements also becoming slower, more hesitant."
    "Mi desmoronamiento también debe de afectarle a Amicus, que frunce el ceño confundido y se mueve más despacio y con más vacilación."

# game/a1s5.rpy:330
translate spanish a1s5_9d469299:

    # "Fuck."
    "Joder."

# game/a1s5.rpy:331
translate spanish a1s5_55715bc8:

    # "I think I feel sweat running down my face, probably turning my striped makeup into a streaked mess."
    "Creo sentir sudor recorriéndome la cara, probablemente convirtiendo mis rayas de maquillaje en un desastre de manchas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:332
translate spanish a1s5_05deaa23:

    # "Several times, I'm caught staring at Amicus, unsure of what to do until I look over at Alex to see what he's doing."
    "Varias veces me quedo mirando a Amicus sin saber qué hacer hasta que miro a Alex para comprobar sus movimientos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:334
translate spanish a1s5_afa61984:

    # "The cat looks totally in his element, stretching and elongating his body luxuriously in tandem with Cassius."
    "El gato está completamente en su elemento, estirando y alargando el cuerpo con soltura a la vez que Cassius."

# game/a1s5.rpy:335
translate spanish a1s5_0c0f5821:

    # "The wolf isn't bad himself, taking the clear lead in the dance as he dips and sways with Alex's body."
    "El lobo tampoco lo hace mal; lleva claramente la iniciativa y se inclina y balancea junto al cuerpo de Alex."

# game/a1s5.rpy:336
translate spanish a1s5_cee9534d:

    # "Meanwhile, I fumble around with Amicus, watching as the powder on my sweaty arms smears on his fur, leaving long, black smudges on his chest and arms."
    "Mientras tanto, yo me muevo torpemente con Amicus, viendo cómo el polvo de mis brazos sudorosos se extiende por su pelo y deja largas manchas negras en su pecho y brazos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:337
translate spanish a1s5_e46a2aa9:

    # "Finally, we get to Meera's death and at least I know when this is supposed to happen because I see Amicus reach out dramatically for me."
    "Por fin llegamos a la muerte de Meera; al menos sé cuándo debe ocurrir porque veo a Amicus extenderse dramáticamente hacia mí."

# game/a1s5.rpy:338
translate spanish a1s5_8a3c3503:

    # "This is the only moment in the entire dance that I feel confident in what I'm doing, and I put everything into my swoon...but so does Alex."
    "Es el único momento de todo el baile en que me siento seguro, y lo doy todo en mi desmayo...pero Alex también."

# game/a1s5.rpy:341
translate spanish a1s5_be895559:

    # "Amicus is already next to me to catch me before I can start to fall, but Alex swoons while Cassius is still meters away from him, but the other wolf smoothly glides to his side to catch him."
    "Amicus ya está a mi lado para atraparme antes de que empiece a caer, pero Alex se desmaya cuando Cassius todavía está a metros; el otro lobo se desliza con fluidez a su lado para sostenerlo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:342
translate spanish a1s5_00dee0a2:

    # "Alex lays there in Cassius's arms, splayed out dramatically, looking somehow serene and distressed at the same time."
    "Alex permanece en los brazos de Cassius, extendido dramáticamente, con una expresión serena y angustiada a la vez."

# game/a1s5.rpy:343
translate spanish a1s5_b94711b6:

    # "The spotlight almost makes the pair glitter, and even I feel like there's a good deal of chemistry between the two of them."
    "El foco casi hace brillar a la pareja, e incluso yo siento que hay bastante química entre ambos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:344
translate spanish a1s5_08f45fef:

    # "There had been a small but definite hope on my end that Alex might help us out here, maybe throw the dance in our favor with a fall or stumble, but it looks like he's putting everything into the performance."
    "Yo albergaba una pequeña pero clara esperanza de que Alex nos ayudara aquí, quizá inclinando el baile a nuestro favor con una caída o un tropiezo, pero parece entregarse por completo a la actuación."

# game/a1s5.rpy:345
translate spanish a1s5_ddfc30d3:

    # "Cassius, despite his reputation of being weak, looks strong and confident, easily supporting Alex's weight as the cat dips further toward the ground."
    "Cassius, a pesar de su fama de débil, parece fuerte y seguro, sosteniendo fácilmente a Alex mientras el gato se inclina más hacia el suelo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:346
translate spanish a1s5_480cf2a6:

    # "At the same time, the wolf's howl reaches a new pitch, the climax of the story."
    "Al mismo tiempo, el aullido del lobo alcanza un nuevo tono, el clímax de la historia."

# game/a1s5.rpy:347
translate spanish a1s5_f54cd2f1:

    # "And that's when Alex turns his head to Cassius for a deep, passionate kiss."
    "Y entonces Alex vuelve la cabeza hacia Cassius para darle un beso profundo y apasionado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:349
translate spanish a1s5_9569173f:

    # "Even though Meera's supposed to be gone at this point, Alex reaches up to caress Cassius's face, pulling him in deeper."
    "Aunque a estas alturas Meera debería haber muerto, Alex alza la pata para acariciar el rostro de Cassius y atraerlo más."

# game/a1s5.rpy:350
translate spanish a1s5_93ea01d0:

    # "Meanwhile, their bodies press closely together, Cassius very clearly grinding his hips against the cat's, the paw that's not supporting Alex instead running up his thigh—"
    "Mientras tanto, sus cuerpos se aprietan; Cassius frota claramente sus caderas contra las del gato, y la pata que no sostiene a Alex recorre su muslo—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:351
translate spanish a1s5_f8f06bcf:

    # "—before dipping under Alex's underwear, pushing it up until most of the cat's thigh is showing."
    "—antes de meterse bajo la ropa interior de Alex y levantarla hasta dejar visible casi todo el muslo del gato."

# game/a1s5.rpy:352
translate spanish a1s5_9361ac90:

    # "And they just...writhe against each other like that, as if caught in the throes of passion, the movements of their muzzles telling me that a lot is going on past those lips."
    "Y simplemente...se retuercen uno contra otro, como atrapados por la pasión; los movimientos de sus hocicos me dicen que ocurre mucho detrás de esos labios."

# game/a1s5.rpy:353
translate spanish a1s5_87ac7f06:

    # "The entire act stuns me, almost making me forget about the disaster that our own dance had been."
    "Toda la escena me deja atónito y casi me hace olvidar el desastre que fue nuestro baile."

# game/a1s5.rpy:354
translate spanish a1s5_1d236729:

    # "Cassius turns, carrying Alex with him as he faces them in the other direction, never breaking the kiss, in fact their groping and grinding getting even more intense."
    "Cassius gira, llevando a Alex consigo para orientarse al otro lado, sin interrumpir el beso; de hecho, sus caricias y roces se vuelven aún más intensos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:355
translate spanish a1s5_ca1da69a:

    # "He's giving everyone a good view of what's happening."
    "Está dando a todos una buena vista de lo que ocurre."

# game/a1s5.rpy:356
translate spanish a1s5_96d90880:

    # "If the whole idea of the dance is to capture attention and make the story and feelings believable—"
    "Si la idea del baile es captar la atención y hacer creíbles la historia y los sentimientos—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:357
translate spanish a1s5_40f16b6b:

    # "—well, I believe them."
    "—bueno, yo me lo creo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:358
translate spanish a1s5_1ec705ee:

    # "In fact, I believe there's a lot more going on between the two than I'd originally thought."
    "De hecho, creo que hay mucho más entre los dos de lo que pensaba."

# game/a1s5.rpy:359
translate spanish a1s5_4f04b87c:

    # "That might explain why Alex wouldn't want to hurt Cassius's chances of being emperor."
    "Eso podría explicar por qué Alex no querría perjudicar las posibilidades de Cassius de convertirse en emperador."

# game/a1s5.rpy:360
translate spanish a1s5_faa6bfca:

    # "Maybe my hopes that Alex would help us were completely naive."
    "Quizá mis esperanzas de que Alex nos ayudara eran completamente ingenuas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:361
translate spanish a1s5_348ca4dc:

    # "And that's when I'm suddenly snapped back to reality as I hear Amicus grunt above me."
    "Y entonces vuelvo de golpe a la realidad al oír a Amicus gruñir sobre mí."

# game/a1s5.rpy:365
translate spanish a1s5_c8d24ff5:

    # "I'd been so enamored with Cassius and Alex's kiss that I'd forgotten our own."
    "Estaba tan cautivado por el beso de Cassius y Alex que olvidé el nuestro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:366
translate spanish a1s5_45a15763:

    # "Seeing a preview of what I might have to do with Amicus though..."
    "Pero, después de ver un adelanto de lo que quizá tenga que hacer con Amicus..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:367
translate spanish a1s5_4c727759:

    # "I blush, steeling myself, getting ready as the wolf starts to lean down toward me, his lips puckered up slightly."
    "Me sonrojo y me preparo, armándome de valor mientras el lobo se inclina hacia mí con los labios ligeramente fruncidos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:368
translate spanish a1s5_18096a30:

    # "I ready my own lips, but then suddenly Amicus turns his head to the side slightly, landing the kiss on my cheek instead."
    "Preparo mis propios labios, pero de repente Amicus gira un poco la cabeza y me besa la mejilla."

# game/a1s5.rpy:369
translate spanish a1s5_4bc9a7db:

    # "It's soft and fleeting, and before I know it, Amicus has pulled back before gently lowering me to the cold marble below."
    "Es suave y fugaz y, antes de darme cuenta, Amicus se ha retirado y me baja con delicadeza al frío mármol."

# game/a1s5.rpy:372
translate spanish a1s5_a2c72c42:

    # "I recognize the word Adastra in the howl before everything goes quiet."
    "Reconozco la palabra Adastra en el aullido antes de que todo quede en silencio."

# game/a1s5.rpy:373
translate spanish a1s5_77ebde85:

    # "I hear Alex getting up just a few feet away, so I do the same, Amicus quickly hurrying over to help me up in my dress."
    "Oigo a Alex levantarse a poca distancia, así que hago lo mismo; Amicus se apresura a ayudarme con el vestido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:374
translate spanish a1s5_c4e1b9fb:

    # "It's only then that I see the various drones floating around above us, the attached lenses making me realize that they're cameras."
    "Solo entonces veo los diversos drones flotando sobre nosotros, y las lentes que llevan me hacen comprender que son cámaras."

# game/a1s5.rpy:375
translate spanish a1s5_16d91e82:

    # "I quickly duck my head, not wanting the people to see the smeared, offensive makeup on my face."
    "Agacho rápidamente la cabeza, sin querer que el pueblo vea el maquillaje ofensivo y corrido de mi cara."

# game/a1s5.rpy:376
translate spanish a1s5_103bbff5:

    # "Amicus holds me close to his side, not saying anything, thankfully."
    "Amicus me sostiene cerca de su costado, sin decir nada, por suerte."

# game/a1s5.rpy:377
translate spanish a1s5_90a6aed1:

    # "Cassius continues to look straight ahead and I can see Alex glancing at us, looking confused."
    "Cassius sigue mirando al frente y veo que Alex nos mira de reojo, confundido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:378
translate spanish a1s5_a878c870:

    # "Then Com's voice—"
    "Entonces, la voz de Com—"

# game/a1s5.rpy:379
translate spanish a1s5_c06914b3:

    # com "\"The triumvirates have made their decisions.\""
    com "\"Los triunviros han tomado sus decisiones.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:380
translate spanish a1s5_ab87d680:

    # com "\"Lupas: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Lupas: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:381
translate spanish a1s5_9f8bbc6d:

    # com "\"Ad Rotae: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Ad Rotae: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:382
translate spanish a1s5_b0d89cbb:

    # com "\"Lux: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Lux: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:383
translate spanish a1s5_9cf22962:

    # com "\"Gebii: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Gebii: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:384
translate spanish a1s5_d09071ad:

    # com "\"Tricelli: Cassius.\""
    com "\"Tricelli: Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:385
translate spanish a1s5_ce90c583:

    # com "\"Adastra?\""
    com "\"¿Adastra?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:386
translate spanish a1s5_61801520:

    # "The camera drones swivel to focus on Cato."
    "Los drones cámara giran para enfocar a Cato."

# game/a1s5.rpy:387
translate spanish a1s5_638c98a4:

    # "He shifts on his throne before grunting out his answer."
    "Se mueve en el trono antes de responder con un gruñido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:388
translate spanish a1s5_967469f5:

    # ca "\"Cassius.\""
    ca "\"Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:389
translate spanish a1s5_7b908acd:

    # com "\"The trial has been decided. Cassius is the victor.\""
    com "\"La prueba está decidida. Cassius es el vencedor.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:390
translate spanish a1s5_0697cdfe:

    # "There's a moment of stunned silence, then the windows un-tint and the camera drones lazily drift away up into some ceiling compartment."
    "Hay un momento de silencio atónito; después las ventanas recuperan la transparencia y los drones cámara se alejan perezosamente hacia un compartimento del techo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:392
translate spanish a1s5_163e978f:

    # "I'm left standing there, looking around at the others."
    "Me quedo de pie mirando a los demás."

# game/a1s5.rpy:393
translate spanish a1s5_dbe187a0:

    # "Cato is walking down the steps from the throne, in the direction of Cassius."
    "Cato baja los escalones del trono hacia Cassius."

# game/a1s5.rpy:394
translate spanish a1s5_a8dbacaf:

    # "Meanwhile, Virginia is whispering to Neferu behind a fan she's casually waving into her face."
    "Mientras tanto, Virginia susurra a Neferu detrás de un abanico que agita despreocupadamente hacia la cara."

# game/a1s5.rpy:395
translate spanish a1s5_4c8352f8:

    # "Cassius is petting Alex's head, murmuring to him under his breath."
    "Cassius acaricia la cabeza de Alex y le murmura en voz baja."

# game/a1s5.rpy:397
translate spanish a1s5_275f495a:

    # "Finally, Amicus stands awkwardly to my side, not even looking at me, his paws behind his back and his eyes on Cato."
    "Por último, Amicus permanece incómodo a mi lado, sin siquiera mirarme, con las patas detrás de la espalda y los ojos en Cato."

# game/a1s5.rpy:398
translate spanish a1s5_81e89092:

    # "I suddenly realize again how stupid I look."
    "De repente vuelvo a comprender lo estúpido que parezco."

# game/a1s5.rpy:399
translate spanish a1s5_bce5d4ee:

    # m "\"Can I go change?\""
    m "\"¿Puedo ir a cambiarme?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:400
translate spanish a1s5_a8492353:

    # "I mumble to Amicus, keeping my voice low like everyone else, as if we're in a library, or something."
    "Se lo murmuro a Amicus en voz baja, como todos los demás, como si estuviéramos en una biblioteca o algo así."

# game/a1s5.rpy:402
translate spanish a1s5_2f80f450:

    # a "\"Um, sure. Do you want—\""
    a "\"Eh, claro. ¿Quieres—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:403
translate spanish a1s5_d6d2580b:

    # "I don't let him finish."
    "No lo dejo terminar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:404
translate spanish a1s5_3ce635ba:

    # "I'm walking as fast as I can to the double doors, knowing that everyone's eyes are on my back as I pause to touch the black panel."
    "Camino hacia las puertas dobles tan deprisa como puedo, sabiendo que todos me miran la espalda mientras me detengo a tocar el panel negro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:408
translate spanish a1s5_b95f91f4:

    # "Once I'm in the main hall, I'm able to breathe a little easier, starting to feel the anger coming up through the absolute humiliation."
    "Una vez en el pasillo principal puedo respirar mejor y siento surgir la ira a través de la humillación absoluta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:409
translate spanish a1s5_d49d7f8c:

    # "I don't know exactly what I'm angry at."
    "No sé exactamente con qué estoy enfadado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:410
translate spanish a1s5_a10a4c5d:

    # "Not Amicus, even though he maybe should have had an idea that howls don't translate."
    "No con Amicus, aunque quizá debería haber imaginado que los aullidos no se traducen."

# game/a1s5.rpy:411
translate spanish a1s5_da6e97a5:

    # "Not Cato or the triumvirates; they'd made the right decision."
    "Ni Cato ni los triunviros; ellos habían tomado la decisión correcta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:412
translate spanish a1s5_5649fce7:

    # "I'd been a complete disaster out there."
    "He sido un completo desastre ahí dentro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:413
translate spanish a1s5_446b61b5:

    # "I guess I'm just mad at this whole system, that the responsibility of getting home rests on me just as much as the guy that got me here in the first place."
    "Supongo que estoy enfadado con todo este sistema, con que la responsabilidad de volver a casa recaiga tanto en mí como en quien me trajo aquí."

# game/a1s5.rpy:414
translate spanish a1s5_d8a25815:

    # "It isn't fair."
    "No es justo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:415
translate spanish a1s5_0e715722:

    # "So I guess I am pissed at Amicus in a way, but the anger is a lot broader than that, I'm angry at the entire situation."
    "Así que supongo que sí estoy algo cabreado con Amicus, pero mi ira es mucho más amplia: estoy enfadado con toda la situación."

# game/a1s5.rpy:418
translate spanish a1s5_3be80643:

    # "I go straight to the bathroom, roughly trying to yank off the stupid dress."
    "Voy directamente al baño e intento arrancarme bruscamente el estúpido vestido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:420
translate spanish a1s5_b2d96918:

    # "It's tight around my neck and I spend the next minute doing an awkward dance, trying to find the buttons on the back so I can loosen it."
    "Me aprieta el cuello y paso el siguiente minuto haciendo un baile torpe, buscando los botones de la espalda para aflojarlo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:421
translate spanish a1s5_de838570:

    # "Eventually, I just rip it off before wiggling out of the dress, feeling a little guilty only after I see the beautiful fabric crumpled up on the ground."
    "Al final lo arranco y me retuerzo para salir del vestido; solo siento un poco de culpa al ver la hermosa tela arrugada en el suelo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:422
translate spanish a1s5_12c12adb:

    # "I stand there, breathing heavily, sweaty and hot."
    "Me quedo ahí, respirando con fuerza, sudoroso y acalorado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:423
translate spanish a1s5_f56edc80:

    # "I look in the mirror and I'm a little surprised to see the makeup still mostly intact on my face."
    "Miro el espejo y me sorprende un poco ver que el maquillaje de mi cara sigue casi intacto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:424
translate spanish a1s5_269b5e3e:

    # "Which reminds me; I'm also pissed that the first time I get paraded out to the public, it's in a racist costume and makeup."
    "Eso me recuerda que también estoy cabreado porque la primera vez que me muestran al público llevo un disfraz y maquillaje racistas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:426
translate spanish a1s5_620236bc:

    # "I get in the shower, letting the hot water run over my face, feeling a little better now that I'm alone with my thoughts...and out of the tight dress."
    "Me meto en la ducha y dejo correr el agua caliente por mi cara; me siento algo mejor ahora que estoy solo con mis pensamientos...y fuera del vestido ajustado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:427
translate spanish a1s5_b62dd7c8:

    # "Still, my mood is a bit dark."
    "Aun así, mi humor sigue siendo sombrío."

# game/a1s5.rpy:428
translate spanish a1s5_8d100195:

    # "I guess now I can actually start to consider that I might be living here forever."
    "Supongo que ahora puedo empezar a considerar de verdad que quizá viva aquí para siempre."

# game/a1s5.rpy:429
translate spanish a1s5_8cea7ebd:

    # "While my mind initially rejects the idea, I guess it's not the worst fate."
    "Aunque mi mente rechaza la idea al principio, supongo que no es el peor destino."

# game/a1s5.rpy:430
translate spanish a1s5_5b3f39a1:

    # "I'll at least be living in a palace with Amicus, and I know he'd take care of me."
    "Al menos viviré en un palacio con Amicus, y sé que me cuidaría."

# game/a1s5.rpy:431
translate spanish a1s5_98df8710:

    # "At least I think he would."
    "O al menos eso creo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:432
translate spanish a1s5_90ce1aad:

    # "Maybe this whole pet thing is temporary, and if he loses the trials, he'll just throw me out with the trash, maybe kill me like he'd once mentioned on the ship."
    "Quizá todo esto de la mascota sea temporal y, si pierde las pruebas, simplemente me tire con la basura; quizá me mate, como mencionó una vez en la nave."

# game/a1s5.rpy:433
translate spanish a1s5_5f0f16be:

    # "Under my gloomy contemplations though, I know that that's not the case."
    "Pero, bajo mis reflexiones sombrías, sé que no es así."

# game/a1s5.rpy:434
translate spanish a1s5_080ab4aa:

    # "He wouldn't do that, but I can't promise myself that I'd be able to keep friendly with him if things really do go south."
    "No lo haría, pero no puedo prometerme que seguiría siendo su amigo si las cosas realmente se tuercen."

# game/a1s5.rpy:435
translate spanish a1s5_974aa331:

    # "He'd told me this would be easy so many times."
    "Me había dicho tantas veces que sería fácil."

# game/a1s5.rpy:437
translate spanish a1s5_1d58eab3:

    # "Even if the Lingua hadn't messed up, I doubt we still would have won."
    "Incluso si la Lingua no hubiera fallado, dudo que hubiéramos ganado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:438
translate spanish a1s5_b5912efa:

    # "After a good half hour, I finally get out of the shower."
    "Después de media hora larga, por fin salgo de la ducha."

# game/a1s5.rpy:440
translate spanish a1s5_e4363b7f:

    # "I stand in front of the fans for a bit, enjoying the way it whips my hair around before I pick up some underwear off the hook and tie it on."
    "Me quedo un poco ante los ventiladores, disfrutando cómo me agitan el pelo, antes de tomar ropa interior de un gancho y atármela."

# game/a1s5.rpy:442
translate spanish a1s5_b5520618:

    # "I'm pretty fast at doing that now, not even having to think about it."
    "Ahora lo hago bastante deprisa, sin siquiera tener que pensarlo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:443
translate spanish a1s5_ea39fbfa:

    # "Finally, I open the door."
    "Por fin abro la puerta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:446
translate spanish a1s5_ffe221cd:

    # "The cool air that rushes in is refreshing after such a hot shower, but I'm immediately treated to the sight of Amicus walking away from the door, probably in the middle of pacing."
    "El aire fresco que entra resulta agradable tras una ducha tan caliente, pero enseguida veo a Amicus alejarse de la puerta, probablemente paseando de un lado a otro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:447
translate spanish a1s5_43f14fc6:

    # "He immediately turns around at the sound though, his eyes wide."
    "Al oírme se vuelve inmediatamente, con los ojos muy abiertos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:450
translate spanish a1s5_42904937:

    # a "\"Hey! [mc], how are you?\""
    a "\"¡Oye! [mc], ¿cómo estás?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:451
translate spanish a1s5_8e732c02:

    # m "\"Great.\""
    m "\"Genial.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:452
translate spanish a1s5_55a134da:

    # "I walk over to the dresser, opening the one that's full of children's robes."
    "Me acerco a la cómoda y abro el cajón lleno de túnicas para niños."

# game/a1s5.rpy:454
translate spanish a1s5_af121244:

    # a "\"Really?\""
    a "\"¿De verdad?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:455
translate spanish a1s5_910f899d_1:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Claro.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:456
translate spanish a1s5_19535f1b:

    # "I hear Amicus huff behind me."
    "Oigo a Amicus resoplar detrás de mí."

# game/a1s5.rpy:458
translate spanish a1s5_342ce654:

    # a "\"Please, I don't want to deal with that mood of yours right now. I just want to talk.\""
    a "\"Por favor, no quiero lidiar ahora con ese humor tuyo. Solo quiero hablar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:459
translate spanish a1s5_40036353:

    # "That's fair, but him telling me to stop sulking is just making me sulkier."
    "Es justo, pero que me diga que deje de estar de mal humor solo me pone peor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:460
translate spanish a1s5_49742c09:

    # m "\"You know, I would have loved to just talk like, a week ago about this stupid trial. Imagine how much better it would have gone if I'd actually MEMORIZED the dance rather than just following cues from you and the song.\""
    m "\"Sabes, me habría encantado hablar de esta estúpida prueba hace una semana. Imagina cuánto mejor habría salido si realmente hubiera MEMORIZADO el baile en lugar de seguir tus señales y la canción.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:461
translate spanish a1s5_d1c3f61b:

    # "I whip out a robe."
    "Saco una túnica de un tirón."

# game/a1s5.rpy:462
translate spanish a1s5_5b7905b9:

    # m "\"Which, by the way, isn't a song. You always make fun of Earthlings and our primitive ways, but at least we actually have a variety of music. Oh, and we can actually sing, not those creepy howling sounds that sound like you're dying.\""
    m "\"Que, por cierto, no es una canción. Siempre te burlas de los terrícolas y nuestras costumbres primitivas, pero al menos tenemos variedad de música. Y, además, sí sabemos cantar, en lugar de esos aullidos espeluznantes que suenan como si estuvierais muriendo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:463
translate spanish a1s5_e2e1711a:

    # "Amicus frowns at me, his ears flat."
    "Amicus me mira con el ceño fruncido y las orejas aplastadas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:465
translate spanish a1s5_b7d83b26:

    # a "\"You're upset.\""
    a "\"Estás molesto.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:466
translate spanish a1s5_da841932:

    # m "\"Noooo, what made you think that?\""
    m "\"Nooo, ¿qué te ha hecho pensar eso?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:468
translate spanish a1s5_33a3aca3:

    # a "\"Stop it, [mc]. I'm just as upset and disappointed as you probably are...was it the cameras, maybe Cato that made you nervous? What happened?\""
    a "\"Basta, [mc]. Estoy tan molesto y decepcionado como probablemente lo estés tú...¿fueron las cámaras, o quizá Cato, lo que te puso nervioso? ¿Qué pasó?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:469
translate spanish a1s5_848cf6a9:

    # "I'm quiet for a moment as I start tying on my robe, then suddenly Amicus's paw reaches out, grabbing my right hand and yanking it away from my clothing."
    "Me quedo callado un momento mientras empiezo a atarme la túnica; de repente Amicus extiende una pata, me agarra la mano derecha y la aparta de la ropa de un tirón."

# game/a1s5.rpy:470
translate spanish a1s5_8ac50353:

    # m "\"What—\""
    m "\"Qué—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:472
translate spanish a1s5_1c1bef42:

    # a "\"What happened to your paw!?\""
    a "\"¿¡Qué le ha pasado a tu pata!?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:473
translate spanish a1s5_e70b4fe7:

    # "I look up and see the wolf staring at the palm side of my hand with wide eyes before turning it this way and that."
    "Alzo la mirada y veo al lobo observar mi palma con los ojos muy abiertos antes de girarla de un lado a otro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:474
translate spanish a1s5_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:475
translate spanish a1s5_4b4d8fbe:

    # a "\"Your skin it's...it's bunching up! Are you having a reaction to the powder?\""
    a "\"Tu piel...¡se está arrugando! ¿Tienes una reacción al polvo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:476
translate spanish a1s5_8c4ff8cd:

    # "I stare at him, confused before pulling my hand away to look at my pruney fingers."
    "Lo miro confundido antes de retirar la mano y mirar mis dedos arrugados."

# game/a1s5.rpy:477
translate spanish a1s5_6d958df2:

    # m "\"No, I was just in the shower too long. My skin does that when I'm wet for a long time.\""
    m "\"No, solo he estado demasiado tiempo en la ducha. Mi piel hace eso cuando está mojada mucho rato.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:478
translate spanish a1s5_132d1aad:

    # a "\"I've never noticed that before.\""
    a "\"Nunca lo había notado.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:479
translate spanish a1s5_ea2adea3:

    # m "\"You take short showers.\""
    m "\"Tú te duchas poco tiempo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:481
translate spanish a1s5_1f1229a1:

    # "The wolf frowns at me, then snatches my hand up again to stare at the fingers in fascination, even as I try to yank it back."
    "El lobo frunce el ceño y vuelve a agarrarme la mano para mirar fascinado los dedos, incluso mientras intento retirarla."

# game/a1s5.rpy:482
translate spanish a1s5_85455094:

    # "At that point, I feel my mood about to take a turn in one of two directions: either exploding at Amicus in frustration and anger over everything...or just laughing."
    "Entonces siento que mi humor puede tomar una de dos direcciones: explotar contra Amicus de frustración e ira por todo...o simplemente reírme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:483
translate spanish a1s5_805a3c9d:

    # "And I find myself doing the latter, chuckling at first before letting out a loud guffaw."
    "Y termino haciendo lo segundo, riéndome suavemente al principio antes de soltar una fuerte carcajada."

# game/a1s5.rpy:484
translate spanish a1s5_a67fb761:

    # "Amicus gives me a strange look, finally letting me go."
    "Amicus me mira extrañado y por fin me suelta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:485
translate spanish a1s5_6ffd912b:

    # a "\"Are you sure you're alright? You're worrying me.\""
    a "\"¿Seguro que estás bien? Me estás preocupando.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:486
translate spanish a1s5_11892b9f:

    # "I sigh as I finish tying on my robe before flopping back onto the bed, hands above my head as I let the pleasant, cool air drift down from the ceiling to blanket my body."
    "Suspiro al terminar de atarme la túnica y me dejo caer en la cama, con las manos sobre la cabeza, dejando que el agradable aire fresco del techo cubra mi cuerpo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:487
translate spanish a1s5_5059dfe0:

    # "I know I'm going to get cold in a few minutes, but for now it feels good."
    "Sé que dentro de unos minutos tendré frío, pero ahora resulta agradable."

# game/a1s5.rpy:488
translate spanish a1s5_0e9b1c5f:

    # m "\"Remember how you said the Lingua has trouble translating some things?\""
    m "\"¿Recuerdas que dijiste que la Lingua tiene problemas para traducir algunas cosas?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:489
translate spanish a1s5_7a535c43:

    # a "\"Yes, I—\""
    a "\"Sí, yo—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:491
translate spanish a1s5_7fa4319c:

    # "I hear the wolf pause as he figures out what went wrong."
    "Oigo al lobo detenerse al comprender qué salió mal."

# game/a1s5.rpy:492
translate spanish a1s5_2b3aff93:

    # m "\"Heard nothing but wailing Latin in that howling noise. I had no idea what I was doing.\""
    m "\"Solo oía lamentos en latín en aquellos aullidos. No tenía idea de lo que hacía.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:494
translate spanish a1s5_e1993f2a:

    # a "\"Oh gods...\""
    a "\"Oh, dioses...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:495
translate spanish a1s5_691b4f26:

    # "There's a heavy thump and I feel the mattress crater and tilt sideways a bit as Amicus sits down next to me."
    "Hay un fuerte golpe y siento el colchón hundirse e inclinarse un poco al sentarse Amicus a mi lado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:496
translate spanish a1s5_b070bcd0:

    # m "\"So yeah.\""
    m "\"Así que sí.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:497
translate spanish a1s5_f5aff05e:

    # a "\"[mc], I'm so sorry. I didn't even contemplate that possibility!\""
    a "\"[mc], lo siento muchísimo. ¡Ni siquiera contemplé esa posibilidad!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:498
translate spanish a1s5_1abd2645:

    # m "\"It's fine...I don't think either of us could have.\""
    m "\"No pasa nada...no creo que ninguno de los dos pudiera haberlo previsto.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:499
translate spanish a1s5_0dcc5823:

    # a "\"I mean, I've listened to music from the cats before, and I've never had an issue with lyrics translating...\""
    a "\"Quiero decir, he escuchado música de los gatos y nunca tuve problemas con la traducción de las letras...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:500
translate spanish a1s5_8619f2c6_1:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/a1s5.rpy:501
translate spanish a1s5_06272fce:

    # m "\"I dunno, doesn't the Lingua try to understand intention, too? Maybe I'm meant to hear the 'true' language when you guys sing. It was happening while you were doing your song, even though I didn't realize it then.\""
    m "\"No sé, ¿la Lingua no intenta comprender también la intención? Quizá deba oír el idioma 'verdadero' cuando cantáis. Pasaba mientras cantabas tu canción, aunque entonces no me di cuenta.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:503
translate spanish a1s5_8d79f2fa:

    # a "\"Oh...you heard me sing?\""
    a "\"Oh...¿me oíste cantar?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:504
translate spanish a1s5_1f941374:

    # "I can hear the embarrassment in Amicus's voice."
    "Oigo la vergüenza en la voz de Amicus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:505
translate spanish a1s5_02696606:

    # m "\"Yeah...it sounded fine, honestly. I was just being a dick earlier.\""
    m "\"Sí...sonaba bien, sinceramente. Antes solo estaba siendo un capullo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:507
translate spanish a1s5_f27c8d9c:

    # a "\"I know.\""
    a "\"Lo sé.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:508
translate spanish a1s5_1d843b80:

    # m "\"But still, I'm tired of you trashing on human culture.\""
    m "\"Pero aun así, estoy harto de que te metas con la cultura humana.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:510
translate spanish a1s5_f27c8d9c_1:

    # a "\"I know.\""
    a "\"Lo sé.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:511
translate spanish a1s5_ab8291d7:

    # m "\"And I {i}knew{/i} that makeup was offensive by the way. I looked like an idiot for all of Adastra to see.\""
    m "\"Y, por cierto, {i}sabía{/i} que aquel maquillaje era ofensivo. Quedé como un idiota ante toda Adastra.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:513
translate spanish a1s5_e52df36d:

    # a "\"You looked good!\""
    a "\"¡Tenías buen aspecto!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:514
translate spanish a1s5_ca54d236:

    # "I turn my head toward the wolf."
    "Vuelvo la cabeza hacia el lobo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:515
translate spanish a1s5_13b14e9e:

    # m "\"Oh really, fumbling around like an idiot with no clue of what he's doing looks good?\""
    m "\"¿Ah, sí? ¿Moverse torpemente como un idiota sin idea de lo que hace tiene buen aspecto?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:517
translate spanish a1s5_1e2cc053:

    # "Amicus stays quiet this time."
    "Esta vez Amicus se queda callado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:518
translate spanish a1s5_234839c9:

    # "I stare back up at the ceiling."
    "Vuelvo a mirar al techo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:519
translate spanish a1s5_d8906f4b:

    # m "\"I guess at least I'm keeping up the dumb, primitive ape act, right?\""
    m "\"Supongo que al menos mantengo el papel del simio estúpido y primitivo, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:520
translate spanish a1s5_2ac1b71d:

    # "Amicus just sighs, getting up."
    "Amicus solo suspira y se levanta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:521
translate spanish a1s5_f5d7f9d8:

    # "I watch as he slowly walks over to the sofa to sit down."
    "Lo veo caminar despacio al sofá y sentarse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:523
translate spanish a1s5_fb8715c7:

    # a "\"I have to say that although you are a very kind, intelligent person, you're very frustrating when you get into these moods.\""
    a "\"Debo decir que, aunque eres muy amable e inteligente, resultas muy frustrante cuando te pones así.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:524
translate spanish a1s5_f6af47f1:

    # m "\"Frustrating?\""
    m "\"¿Frustrante?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:525
translate spanish a1s5_0bd3f161:

    # a "\"Just so...gloomy and self-defeating. You remind me of Cassius sometimes.\""
    a "\"Tan...sombrío y derrotista. A veces me recuerdas a Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:526
translate spanish a1s5_f75ad5bd:

    # "I pull a face."
    "Hago una mueca."

# game/a1s5.rpy:527
translate spanish a1s5_67681e1a:

    # m "\"Since when is HE self-defeating? He seems pretty full of himself to me.\""
    m "\"¿Desde cuándo es ÉL derrotista? A mí me parece bastante engreído.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:528
translate spanish a1s5_b6df19c2:

    # a "\"You don't know the real Cass. He very much dislikes himself.\""
    a "\"No conoces al verdadero Cass. Se detesta mucho.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:529
translate spanish a1s5_6cba67d9:

    # m "\"Also, don't compare me to your brother. I really don't want to be thinking about him right now.\""
    m "\"Además, no me compares con tu hermano. Ahora no quiero pensar en él.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:531
translate spanish a1s5_848728ea:

    # a "\"I'm just saying, I prefer you in lighter spirits. It suits you more.\""
    a "\"Solo digo que te prefiero de mejor humor. Te sienta mejor.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:532
translate spanish a1s5_85d47c6b:

    # m "\"I'll work on it.\""
    m "\"Lo intentaré.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:533
translate spanish a1s5_0619d6f0:

    # "A long silence goes by and with the way that Amicus is shifting around, I can tell that he wants to ask me something."
    "Pasa un largo silencio y, por cómo se mueve Amicus, noto que quiere preguntarme algo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:534
translate spanish a1s5_3ffe5d76:

    # m "\"What is it?\""
    m "\"¿Qué es?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:536
translate spanish a1s5_42a11706:

    # a "\"Well, uh, I guess that little celebration is out of the question, now?\""
    a "\"Bueno, eh, supongo que esa pequeña celebración queda descartada ahora, ¿no?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:537
translate spanish a1s5_1c18a0dd:

    # m "\"The dinner?\""
    m "\"¿La cena?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:539
translate spanish a1s5_3c6c8a0b:

    # a "\"Um...\""
    a "\"Eh...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:540
translate spanish a1s5_ebe169cc:

    # "I sit up suddenly, giving him an incredulous look."
    "Me incorporo de repente y lo miro con incredulidad."

# game/a1s5.rpy:541
translate spanish a1s5_20710e9d:

    # m "\"Seriously!?\""
    m "\"¿¡En serio!?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:543
translate spanish a1s5_7686489e:

    # a "\"Whoa, I was just kidd—\""
    a "\"Espera, solo bromea—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:544
translate spanish a1s5_9388858f:

    # m "\"We just lost the trial! You're one trial away from losing the emperorship and you're seriously thinking about that—\""
    m "\"¡Acabamos de perder la prueba! ¡Estás a una prueba de perder el título de emperador y de verdad piensas en eso—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:546
translate spanish a1s5_ff4c1277:

    # a "\"I was just having a bit of fun.\""
    a "\"Solo estaba divirtiéndome un poco.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:547
translate spanish a1s5_37a44a46:

    # m "\"No, you want a pity handy.\""
    m "\"No, quieres que te masturbe por lástima.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:549
translate spanish a1s5_1e8d4df8:

    # a "\"It's not like I NEED you to do it. I can get the job done myself.\""
    a "\"No es que NECESITE que lo hagas tú. Puedo hacerlo yo mismo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:550
translate spanish a1s5_ef822471:

    # m "\"Then do it.\""
    m "\"Entonces hazlo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:551
translate spanish a1s5_ea040d9f:

    # a "\"I will.\""
    a "\"Lo haré.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:552
translate spanish a1s5_ec9b9d0c:

    # "Amicus sits there huffily, not making eye contact."
    "Amicus permanece sentado, enfurruñado, sin mirarme a los ojos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:553
translate spanish a1s5_96c1a1de:

    # "I sigh, remembering what the wolf had said about improving my mood."
    "Suspiro, recordando lo que dijo el lobo sobre mejorar mi humor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:554
translate spanish a1s5_0280c633:

    # "I often criticize Amicus for his tantrums, reminding him that it won't help us to sulk."
    "A menudo critico las rabietas de Amicus, recordándole que enfurruñarse no nos ayudará."

# game/a1s5.rpy:555
translate spanish a1s5_f24bc583:

    # "It's kind of hypocritical that I don't hold myself to the same standards."
    "Es bastante hipócrita no exigirme lo mismo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:556
translate spanish a1s5_faaa7e88:

    # m "\"Sorry, I've just got a lot on my mind, obviously.\""
    m "\"Perdona, tengo muchas cosas en la cabeza, evidentemente.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:558
translate spanish a1s5_a0a98e31:

    # a "\"Listen, I know this went much differently than what we had planned, but I will certainly win the next trial. I've debated Cassius many times before.\""
    a "\"Escucha, sé que esto ha salido muy distinto a lo que planeábamos, pero ganaré la siguiente prueba, sin duda. He debatido muchas veces con Cassius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:559
translate spanish a1s5_13cc5f34:

    # m "\"Do I have to do anything?\""
    m "\"¿Tengo que hacer algo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:560
translate spanish a1s5_d5f2c265:

    # a "\"Other than watch? No.\""
    a "\"¿Aparte de mirar? No.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:561
translate spanish a1s5_d9143fab:

    # m "\"When is it?\""
    m "\"¿Cuándo es?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:562
translate spanish a1s5_8aa102b4:

    # a "\"Two weeks from now.\""
    a "\"Dentro de dos semanas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:563
translate spanish a1s5_8659068a:

    # m "\"You'd better win.\""
    m "\"Más te vale ganar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:564
translate spanish a1s5_ea040d9f_1:

    # a "\"I will.\""
    a "\"Lo haré.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:565
translate spanish a1s5_1e9270dc:

    # "I sigh again, realizing that the knot I've had in my stomach the past few weeks has a bit longer to stick around."
    "Vuelvo a suspirar; comprendo que el nudo en mi estómago de estas últimas semanas tendrá que quedarse algo más."

# game/a1s5.rpy:566
translate spanish a1s5_0ce493b2:

    # m "\"And I might still...\""
    m "\"Y quizá todavía...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:567
translate spanish a1s5_8ed4aa57:

    # "I make a jacking motion in the air."
    "Hago un gesto de masturbar con la mano en el aire."

# game/a1s5.rpy:568
translate spanish a1s5_65270a7b:

    # m "\"...later on. I'm just not in the right state of mind right now.\""
    m "\"...más tarde. Ahora mismo no estoy de humor.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:570
translate spanish a1s5_11b99674:

    # a "\"I understand. It was too early to make light of things...though, uh, maybe we could do something else that would make us both feel better?\""
    a "\"Lo entiendo. Era demasiado pronto para bromear...aunque, eh, ¿quizá podríamos hacer algo más que nos hiciera sentir mejor a los dos?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:571
translate spanish a1s5_41d63ee8:

    # m "\"Something else?\""
    m "\"¿Algo más?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:573
translate spanish a1s5_513d3004:

    # a "\"Yes, like, I could just...hold you?\""
    a "\"Sí, podría simplemente...¿abrazarte?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:574
translate spanish a1s5_32cc6e34:

    # "Amicus's voice gets uncharacteristically high on the last word."
    "La voz de Amicus se vuelve inusualmente aguda en la última palabra."

# game/a1s5.rpy:575
translate spanish a1s5_9ed7282c:

    # m "\"Hold me.\""
    m "\"Abrazarme.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:576
translate spanish a1s5_785fb1c7:

    # "I repeat his words."
    "Repito sus palabras."

# game/a1s5.rpy:577
translate spanish a1s5_93436c41:

    # m "\"Why would you want to do that?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué querrías hacer eso?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:579
translate spanish a1s5_0492a42c:

    # a "\"Well, companionship is part of pet duties, and holding, or embracing is often how it is expressed. It might also be comforting to you considering how stressful the past few hours have been.\""
    a "\"Bueno, la compañía es parte de los deberes de una mascota, y sostenerse o abrazarse suele ser una forma de expresarla. También podría consolarte después del estrés de estas últimas horas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:581
translate spanish a1s5_a9da3ed0:

    # "Again, that hopeful look and again I actually feel bad for him."
    "Otra vez esa mirada esperanzada, y otra vez siento verdadera pena por él."

# game/a1s5.rpy:582
translate spanish a1s5_5d90d281:

    # "How lonely do you have to be to just want to cuddle someone?"
    "¿Qué tan solo tienes que estar para simplemente querer abrazar a alguien?"

# game/a1s5.rpy:583
translate spanish a1s5_e0b2c0ad:

    # "But at the same time, I want to."
    "Pero, al mismo tiempo, yo quiero hacerlo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:584
translate spanish a1s5_6700513a:

    # "I might not want to admit it, but I've also been lonely these past three weeks, emotionally and physically."
    "Quizá no quiera admitirlo, pero también he estado solo estas últimas tres semanas, emocional y físicamente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:585
translate spanish a1s5_1aef7217:

    # "Also, I've really liked our short hugs, so a longer one..."
    "Además, me han gustado mucho nuestros breves abrazos, así que uno más largo..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:586
translate spanish a1s5_491cdce3:

    # "Trying not to look too eager myself, I sigh and stand up."
    "Intentando no parecer demasiado entusiasmado, suspiro y me levanto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:588
translate spanish a1s5_43c2b231:

    # "Amicus's ears immediately perk up in happy surprise."
    "Las orejas de Amicus se levantan inmediatamente en una alegre sorpresa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:589
translate spanish a1s5_7ed7a18c:

    # "He leans back, legs together, waiting as I walk up to him."
    "Se reclina con las piernas juntas y espera mientras me acerco."

# game/a1s5.rpy:591
translate spanish a1s5_ae40e799:

    # a "\"Do you—\""
    a "\"¿Quieres—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:593
translate spanish a1s5_7b57d90d:

    # "I sit down in his lap, a little awkwardly at first as I wobble around, then finally settle on turning sideways, knees drawn up as I lean my shoulder against his chest."
    "Me siento en su regazo, algo torpe al principio mientras me tambaleo, hasta acomodarme de lado, con las rodillas recogidas y el hombro apoyado en su pecho."

# game/a1s5.rpy:594
translate spanish a1s5_d64597e0:

    # "Amicus pauses, then wraps his arms around me."
    "Amicus hace una pausa y luego me rodea con los brazos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:596
translate spanish a1s5_09d70b5a:

    # "Despite the awkward start, I'm amazed at the way I just sort of fit against the curve of his body."
    "A pesar del comienzo incómodo, me asombra cómo encajo en la curva de su cuerpo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:597
translate spanish a1s5_10c54a1a:

    # "His big, furry arms envelop me, and I feel the muscles tighten briefly before relaxing."
    "Sus grandes brazos peludos me envuelven, y siento sus músculos tensarse brevemente antes de relajarse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:598
translate spanish a1s5_eb82cebe:

    # "His soft stomach cushions against my side, making it feel as if I'm leaning a against a big, furry, but firm water bed."
    "Su suave vientre amortigua mi costado, como si me apoyara en una enorme cama de agua peluda pero firme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:599
translate spanish a1s5_bcf4c00d:

    # "His chest is broad and thick, propping my head up comfortably as he scoots his butt out a bit to help us better recline."
    "Su pecho es ancho y grueso y sostiene mi cabeza cómodamente mientras desliza un poco el trasero para ayudarnos a reclinarnos mejor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:600
translate spanish a1s5_e3c26bc9:

    # "Then he tucks my head under his chin, and just like that, I'm surrounded by his warmth, the cold that had started to bite at my bare skin dissipating immediately."
    "Entonces coloca mi cabeza bajo su barbilla y, sin más, su calor me rodea; el frío que empezaba a morder mi piel desnuda desaparece de inmediato."

# game/a1s5.rpy:601
translate spanish a1s5_9780fde3:

    # "I feel a little thrill in my chest at the feeling of having this wolf, so large and powerful, hug and cuddle me so gently."
    "Siento una pequeña emoción en el pecho al tener a este lobo, tan grande y poderoso, abrazándome con tanta delicadeza."

# game/a1s5.rpy:602
translate spanish a1s5_d3e507d3:

    # "Something about that is so...nice."
    "Hay algo tan...agradable en ello."

# game/a1s5.rpy:603
translate spanish a1s5_37ebbb2f:

    # "Amicus just holds me in silence for a while, and I feel his paws shift around a bit, like he's kneading through the robe to the skin on my back."
    "Amicus me sostiene en silencio un rato; siento que sus patas se mueven un poco, como si amasaran a través de la túnica la piel de mi espalda."

# game/a1s5.rpy:604
translate spanish a1s5_5319a1e3:

    # "Finally, his deep voice rumbles through his chest and against my ear."
    "Por fin su voz grave retumba por su pecho contra mi oído."

# game/a1s5.rpy:606
translate spanish a1s5_34344d7a:

    # a "\"Is this alright?\""
    a "\"¿Está bien así?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:607
translate spanish a1s5_0c4ccb85:

    # m "\"Yeah this is...fine.\""
    m "\"Sí, esto está...bien.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:608
translate spanish a1s5_03f47600:

    # "I blush, embarrassed at how much I'm enjoying this."
    "Me sonrojo, avergonzado por cuánto lo estoy disfrutando."

# game/a1s5.rpy:609
translate spanish a1s5_6f2652e4:

    # "Originally, I'd just wanted to make him feel better, but he was right about this making ME feel better."
    "Al principio solo quería hacerlo sentir mejor, pero tenía razón en que también ME haría sentir mejor."

# game/a1s5.rpy:610
translate spanish a1s5_28f12dca:

    # "Amicus rubs his chin down against the top of my head, and I hear him inhale."
    "Amicus frota la barbilla contra mi cabeza y lo oigo inspirar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:611
translate spanish a1s5_2c099a54:

    # a "\"I suppose this isn't a normal thing to do on Earth?\""
    a "\"Supongo que esto no es habitual en la Tierra.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:612
translate spanish a1s5_93a20f57:

    # m "\"Well...it is if you're dating someone. It's not a usual thing with friends, though.\""
    m "\"Bueno...lo es si estás saliendo con alguien. Pero no suele hacerse entre amigos.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:613
translate spanish a1s5_8e5d5cd5:

    # a "\"Ah.\""
    a "\"Ah.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:614
translate spanish a1s5_f40e76e6:

    # "Amicus paws at me a bit more, making those tiny movements as if he's trying to feel me as much as possible without being obvious about it."
    "Amicus me acaricia un poco más, con pequeños movimientos, como intentando tocarme todo lo posible sin hacerlo demasiado evidente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:615
translate spanish a1s5_ee00515d:

    # a "\"What is dating on your planet?\""
    a "\"¿Qué es salir con alguien en tu planeta?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:616
translate spanish a1s5_7aad1fdb:

    # "I shrug, though it's hard to do against the wolf's tight embrace."
    "Me encojo de hombros, aunque resulta difícil en el fuerte abrazo del lobo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:617
translate spanish a1s5_c1554b7e:

    # m "\"Just...asking someone you like out on a date. Basically it just means that you like the person and you want to know more about them and dating helps you do that.\""
    m "\"Solo...invitar a una cita a alguien que te gusta. Básicamente significa que esa persona te gusta y quieres conocerla mejor, y tener citas te ayuda a hacerlo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:618
translate spanish a1s5_27344ab7:

    # a "\"Ah, Sounds fairly casual. So how does one initiate dating?\""
    a "\"Ah, suena bastante informal. Entonces, ¿cómo se empieza a salir con alguien?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:619
translate spanish a1s5_3689bd46:

    # m "\"I dunno, just ask them...give them flowers if you're old-fashioned, but it is pretty casual, honestly.\""
    m "\"No sé, solo se lo pides...le das flores si eres de la vieja escuela, pero es bastante informal, sinceramente.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:620
translate spanish a1s5_31826191:

    # a "\"Mmmh.\""
    a "\"Mmmh.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:621
translate spanish a1s5_ee424f49:

    # m "\"Why are you so curious?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué tienes tanta curiosidad?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:622
translate spanish a1s5_ed4885e5:

    # "It's Amicus's turn to shrug."
    "Ahora le toca a Amicus encogerse de hombros."

# game/a1s5.rpy:623
translate spanish a1s5_c194d5ea:

    # a "\"I always want to be careful about your boundaries. It's easier when I understand your culture better.\""
    a "\"Siempre quiero respetar tus límites. Es más fácil cuando comprendo mejor tu cultura.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:625
translate spanish a1s5_5838500f:

    # "I lean against the wolf, realizing that even though I'd made a complete fool out of myself just half an hour earlier, I feel fine."
    "Me apoyo en el lobo y comprendo que, aunque hice completamente el ridículo hace media hora, me siento bien."

# game/a1s5.rpy:626
translate spanish a1s5_742fe3f2:

    # "I kind of hope that this isn't the last time we do something like this."
    "Espero que esta no sea la última vez que hacemos algo así."

# game/a1s5.rpy:627
translate spanish a1s5_d9c1feb3:

    # "Knowing Amicus, it likely won't be."
    "Conociendo a Amicus, probablemente no lo será."

# game/a1s5.rpy:631
translate spanish a1s5_4723e127:

    # "It's a few days later when I'm finally able to hang out with Alex like we'd planned."
    "Pasan unos días hasta que por fin puedo pasar tiempo con Alex como habíamos planeado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:632
translate spanish a1s5_b139c363:

    # "Cassius had stepped up his campaigning over the past several days as his chances of becoming emperor increased."
    "Cassius había intensificado su campaña durante los últimos días, al aumentar sus posibilidades de ser emperador."

# game/a1s5.rpy:633
translate spanish a1s5_16874e38:

    # "So did Amicus after his decreased."
    "Amicus hizo lo mismo al disminuir las suyas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:634
translate spanish a1s5_fd3e6a87:

    # "The difference being that Alex often found himself going on campaign trips with the white wolf while Amicus always left me behind."
    "La diferencia era que Alex solía acompañar al lobo blanco en sus viajes de campaña, mientras Amicus siempre me dejaba atrás."

# game/a1s5.rpy:635
translate spanish a1s5_03b5d5ea:

    # "I think Amicus had picked up on the fact that I don't like being out in front of so many people after the whole dance incident."
    "Creo que Amicus comprendió que no me gusta estar delante de tanta gente después de todo lo ocurrido en el baile."

# game/a1s5.rpy:636
translate spanish a1s5_34fa4f63:

    # "Still, he promises me that WHEN he wins the next trial, we'll go out to the city to celebrate."
    "Aun así, me promete que, CUANDO gane la siguiente prueba, saldremos a la ciudad a celebrarlo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:637
translate spanish a1s5_fe2172c3:

    # "For now though, I'm happy to stay in the gardens with Alex, enjoying a quiet midday meal as we both talk and sip our tea."
    "Pero por ahora me alegra quedarme en los jardines con Alex, disfrutando de un almuerzo tranquilo mientras hablamos y bebemos té."

# game/a1s5.rpy:639
translate spanish a1s5_c5558f53:

    # al "\"Honestly, they should have us redo the dance if your Lingua wasn't translating.\""
    al "\"Sinceramente, deberían hacernos repetir el baile si tu Lingua no traducía.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:640
translate spanish a1s5_a9c28662:

    # m "\"Was yours?\""
    m "\"¿La tuya sí?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:642
translate spanish a1s5_07e60801:

    # al "\"Well, no, but I knew it wouldn't. Wolves never intend for their lyrics to translate over the Lingua because it ruins the howl, which they see to be the whole point of singing.\""
    al "\"Bueno, no, pero sabía que no lo haría. Los lobos nunca quieren que la Lingua traduzca sus letras, porque arruina el aullido, que para ellos es el propósito de cantar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:643
translate spanish a1s5_61ca8fa6:

    # m "\"Hmm.\""
    m "\"Hmm.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:644
translate spanish a1s5_fa01022d:

    # al "\"I could understand Amicus overlooking that though. Most wolves never see another sibling species in person in their entire lives.\""
    al "\"Aunque entiendo que a Amicus se le pasara. La mayoría de los lobos nunca ven en persona a otra especie Hermana en toda su vida.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:645
translate spanish a1s5_30313647:

    # m "\"Well, it's over now. On to the debate thing they're gonna do next.\""
    m "\"Bueno, ya pasó. Ahora toca ese debate que harán después.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:647
translate spanish a1s5_755f833b:

    # al "\"Oh yes. Cassius has been training with the best rhetorician on the moon; Marcus Manius.\""
    al "\"Oh, sí. Cassius lleva entrenando con el mejor retórico de la luna: Marcus Manius.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:648
translate spanish a1s5_d0a8914c:

    # "I notice that he puts a bit of emphasis on the name and I look over at him."
    "Noto que enfatiza un poco el nombre y lo miro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:649
translate spanish a1s5_8d68dc44:

    # "Alex sips at his tea daintily, watching the fountain lazily."
    "Alex bebe té delicadamente, mirando la fuente con indolencia."

# game/a1s5.rpy:651
translate spanish a1s5_a103548b:

    # al "\"He's offered Cassius many tips on convincing the triumvirates. Very useful tips, actually. Is Amicus doing anything similar?\""
    al "\"Le ha dado a Cassius muchos consejos para convencer a los triunviros. Consejos muy útiles, de hecho. ¿Amicus está haciendo algo parecido?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:652
translate spanish a1s5_f8604b98:

    # "I realize then that Alex is offering me information on what Cassius is doing to prepare for the trial."
    "Entonces comprendo que Alex me está dando información sobre lo que hace Cassius para preparar la prueba."

# game/a1s5.rpy:653
translate spanish a1s5_df26235f:

    # "...At least I think he is."
    "...O al menos eso creo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:654
translate spanish a1s5_374186b6:

    # "Whether that's the case or not, I try to remember the name of the rhetoric guy, knowing I should tell Amicus later."
    "Sea o no así, intento recordar el nombre del retórico, sabiendo que debería contárselo a Amicus después."

# game/a1s5.rpy:655
translate spanish a1s5_d9d6a99b:

    # m "\"I'm not really sure. He hasn't told me all that much about what he's doing, but hopefully it's something similar.\""
    m "\"No estoy muy seguro. No me ha contado mucho de lo que está haciendo, pero espero que sea algo parecido.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:656
translate spanish a1s5_82e5c16e:

    # al "\"Well, I recommend he study the triumvirates and their cities, if only to find the best way to convince them during the second trial.\""
    al "\"Bueno, le recomiendo que estudie a los triunviros y sus ciudades, aunque solo sea para encontrar la mejor forma de convencerlos durante la segunda prueba.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:657
translate spanish a1s5_ce5d7fbf:

    # "Yep, definitely offering me information."
    "Sí, definitivamente me está ofreciendo información."

# game/a1s5.rpy:658
translate spanish a1s5_6efa4ce1:

    # "Thing is, after seeing the way he and Cassius interacted...I wonder if I can fully trust him."
    "El problema es que, después de ver cómo interactuaban él y Cassius...me pregunto si puedo confiar plenamente en él."

# game/a1s5.rpy:659
translate spanish a1s5_cefe972c:

    # m "\"You know, Cassius was saying something earlier while I was serving him about a week ago. Did you know he has plans to get rid of the triumvirates?\""
    m "\"Sabes, Cassius comentó algo cuando lo atendía hace una semana. ¿Sabías que planea eliminar los triunviratos?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:661
translate spanish a1s5_823e8689:

    # "Alex's eyes widen for a moment."
    "Los ojos de Alex se abren un momento."

# game/a1s5.rpy:663
translate spanish a1s5_91f8afae:

    # al "\"Oh really? Hmm, I wonder why?\""
    al "\"¿Ah, sí? Hmm, me pregunto por qué.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:664
translate spanish a1s5_f1b90553:

    # m "\"Something about it being easier to rule directly rather than through elected officials?\""
    m "\"¿Algo sobre que sería más fácil gobernar directamente en lugar de hacerlo a través de funcionarios electos?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:666
translate spanish a1s5_3791602d:

    # al "\"Well, that's some radical thinking, isn't it?\""
    al "\"Bueno, eso es una idea radical, ¿no?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:667
translate spanish a1s5_e5e47c93:

    # m "\"That's what Virginia said.\""
    m "\"Eso dijo Virginia.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:669
translate spanish a1s5_1046ff4a:

    # al "\"Well, she's always been rather reasonable. Honestly—\""
    al "\"Bueno, ella siempre ha sido bastante razonable. Sinceramente—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:670
translate spanish a1s5_923d2253:

    # "Alex leans in, lowering his voice."
    "Alex se inclina y baja la voz."

# game/a1s5.rpy:672
translate spanish a1s5_0deb5748:

    # al "\"I'd rather she become the empress, but unfortunately the Wolves don't allow females to hold positions of much authority, so her chances at the throne are nil.\""
    al "\"Preferiría que ella fuera la emperatriz, pero, por desgracia, los lobos no permiten que las mujeres ocupen cargos con mucha autoridad, así que sus posibilidades de alcanzar el trono son nulas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:674
translate spanish a1s5_0e4c5325:

    # "Alex's eyes suddenly widen as he looks over my shoulder."
    "Los ojos de Alex se abren de repente al mirar sobre mi hombro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:675
translate spanish a1s5_e40c78fb:

    # "I raise my eyebrows, then look back to see Neferu making his way toward us."
    "Alzo las cejas y luego miro atrás para ver a Neferu acercarse."

# game/a1s5.rpy:677
translate spanish a1s5_7ced5ac2:

    # "I turn around to see Alex looking down toward the ground, his tail lashing around before he holds it in his lap."
    "Me vuelvo y veo a Alex mirando al suelo, con la cola agitándose antes de sujetarla en el regazo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:679
translate spanish a1s5_cbc14406:

    # "The jackal stops to stand in front of us."
    "El chacal se detiene frente a nosotros."

# game/a1s5.rpy:680
translate spanish a1s5_a0b2d750:

    # "Without a word, he delicately takes one of Alex's paws and bows low to kiss it."
    "Sin decir nada, toma delicadamente una pata de Alex y se inclina mucho para besarla."

# game/a1s5.rpy:681
translate spanish a1s5_831fa7c5:

    # "Alex raises his other paw to his mouth, blushing furiously."
    "Alex se lleva la otra pata a la boca, sonrojándose intensamente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:682
translate spanish a1s5_bfcbc323:

    # "Meanwhile, Neferu just nods at me."
    "Mientras tanto, Neferu solo me saluda con la cabeza."

# game/a1s5.rpy:683
translate spanish a1s5_70e40f00:

    # n "\"Good day Alex and [mc]. How is your midday meal?\""
    n "\"Buen día, Alex y [mc]. ¿Qué tal vuestro almuerzo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:684
translate spanish a1s5_bb33bcd2:

    # "Alex still has his paw to his mouth, so I answer for him."
    "Alex aún tiene la pata en la boca, así que respondo por él."

# game/a1s5.rpy:685
translate spanish a1s5_e8c65d81:

    # m "\"It's okay. How are you?\""
    m "\"Está bien. ¿Cómo estás?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:687
translate spanish a1s5_bdcc289c:

    # n "\"Splendid!\""
    n "\"¡Espléndidamente!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:688
translate spanish a1s5_97646432:

    # "I notice then that he's carrying a bottle in his paw, the glass glinting in the sunlight with his every move."
    "Entonces noto que lleva una botella en la pata, con el cristal brillando al sol con cada movimiento."

# game/a1s5.rpy:689
translate spanish a1s5_e2998297:

    # n "\"I was just taking a walk through the gardens this morning when I happened across a shockingly large spider that skittered across the ground at my paws.\""
    n "\"Esta mañana paseaba por los jardines cuando me encontré una araña sorprendentemente grande que pasó corriendo por el suelo junto a mis patas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:690
translate spanish a1s5_62259dac:

    # "Neferu sweeps his paw in front of himself, as if showing where the spider ran."
    "Neferu mueve una pata frente a sí, como mostrando por dónde corrió la araña."

# game/a1s5.rpy:692
translate spanish a1s5_27bca162:

    # n "\"I can't help but wonder if I'm in danger here.\""
    n "\"No puedo evitar preguntarme si estoy en peligro aquí.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:693
translate spanish a1s5_3acf07ff:

    # "Alex finally speaks up then, squeaking with the first syllable."
    "Entonces Alex por fin habla, con la primera sílaba aguda."

# game/a1s5.rpy:694
translate spanish a1s5_000d9a32:

    # al "\"N—no, they're rather harmless. Their venom is very mild.\""
    al "\"N—no, son bastante inofensivas. Su veneno es muy leve.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:696
translate spanish a1s5_df7b9cd8:

    # n "\"Ah, well that's a relief to hear, Alex. On my home planet I'd often have to shake my loincloths out before wearing them in case of scorpions.\""
    n "\"Ah, me alivia oírlo, Alex. En mi planeta a menudo tenía que sacudir los taparrabos antes de ponérmelos, por si había escorpiones.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:698
translate spanish a1s5_fc8aa649:

    # al "\"Oh really? That's terrifying.\""
    al "\"¿Ah, sí? Qué aterrador.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:700
translate spanish a1s5_6b33373e:

    # n "\"It certainly can be, but it's something you get used to.\""
    n "\"Desde luego puede serlo, pero es algo a lo que te acostumbras.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:701
translate spanish a1s5_2a23172c:

    # "Alex and Neferu smile at each other for a moment, and I frown at the cat, wondering what the hell he's doing."
    "Alex y Neferu se sonríen un momento, y miro al gato con el ceño fruncido, preguntándome qué demonios hace."

# game/a1s5.rpy:703
translate spanish a1s5_bf382732:

    # n "\"Oh yes! I came to give you this.\""
    n "\"¡Oh, sí! Venía a darte esto.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:704
translate spanish a1s5_cc243d36:

    # "Neferu leans down and holds out the glass bottle and now I see it's filled with a honey-colored liquid that sloshes lazily in the bottle."
    "Neferu se inclina y extiende la botella de cristal; ahora veo que está llena de un líquido color miel que se balancea perezosamente dentro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:706
translate spanish a1s5_3b6edbc4:

    # n "\"The Buna seed oil I promised. Much better for the fur than the Adastran oils they have for us.\""
    n "\"El aceite de semillas de Buna que prometí. Mucho mejor para el pelo que los aceites de Adastra que nos dan.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:707
translate spanish a1s5_73f3a985:

    # "Alex reaches out and takes the bottle, blushing again."
    "Alex extiende la pata y toma la botella, sonrojándose de nuevo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:709
translate spanish a1s5_39d5f337:

    # al "\"Th-thank you Neferu. I'll use it first thing tomorrow.\""
    al "\"G-gracias, Neferu. Lo usaré mañana a primera hora.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:710
translate spanish a1s5_77a8b79e:

    # n "\"And I'll see you again tomorrow to make sure you do!\""
    n "\"¡Y mañana volveré a verte para asegurarme de que lo haces!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:712
translate spanish a1s5_68c23bea:

    # "The jackal winks and I think I hear Alex make a strangled noise in his throat."
    "El chacal guiña un ojo y creo oír a Alex emitir un sonido ahogado en la garganta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:713
translate spanish a1s5_a7a7f5fd:

    # n "\"In the meantime, would you like to take a walk with me?\""
    n "\"Mientras tanto, ¿te gustaría pasear conmigo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:715
translate spanish a1s5_8be0a984:

    # al "\"Uh, oh, I—\""
    al "\"Eh, oh, yo—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:716
translate spanish a1s5_5e9c6746:

    # "Neferu once again extends a paw."
    "Neferu vuelve a extender una pata."

# game/a1s5.rpy:718
translate spanish a1s5_d7dc446a:

    # "Alex coughs awkwardly before reaching out to take it."
    "Alex tose incómodamente antes de tomarla."

# game/a1s5.rpy:720
translate spanish a1s5_75838a24:

    # n "\"Wonderful, you're always such great company. Would you like to join us as well, [mc]?\""
    n "\"Maravilloso, siempre eres una compañía estupenda. ¿Te gustaría acompañarnos también, [mc]?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:721
translate spanish a1s5_9e879a0b:

    # "I think back on what had happened in the baths."
    "Recuerdo lo que ocurrió en los baños."

# game/a1s5.rpy:722
translate spanish a1s5_b8a3ce0a:

    # m "\"No thanks.\""
    m "\"No, gracias.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:723
translate spanish a1s5_3f501016:

    # n "\"In that case, I'll see you around the palace.\""
    n "\"En ese caso, nos veremos por el palacio.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:725
translate spanish a1s5_f2bc826b:

    # al "\"Yeah, see ya, [mc]!\""
    al "\"¡Sí, hasta luego, [mc]!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:729
translate spanish a1s5_81f7b5e7:

    # "Neferu offers his arm to the cat, and just like they're off into the gardens, disappearing around the many bushes lining the footpaths."
    "Neferu le ofrece el brazo al gato y, sin más, se marchan por los jardines, desapareciendo entre los numerosos arbustos que bordean los senderos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:730
translate spanish a1s5_526722de:

    # "I stare after them, a bit confused, still unclear on what exactly the jackal is doing."
    "Los observo alejarse, algo confundido, aún sin comprender qué está haciendo exactamente el chacal."

# game/a1s5.rpy:731
translate spanish a1s5_ab63e441:

    # "I'm also reminded that I need to ask Alex about why the hell he told Neferu about my intelligence."
    "También recuerdo que debo preguntarle a Alex por qué demonios le habló a Neferu de mi inteligencia."

# game/a1s5.rpy:732
translate spanish a1s5_b0491a46:

    # "Only problem is, I don't know how to do that without seeming suspicious."
    "El único problema es que no sé cómo hacerlo sin parecer sospechoso."

# game/a1s5.rpy:733
translate spanish a1s5_3e63b78d:

    # "Technically there isn't a reason why it's supposed to be a secret, and I feel like bringing it up will only give the cat reason to dig more deeply."
    "Técnicamente no hay razón para que sea un secreto, y siento que mencionarlo solo le daría al gato motivos para investigar más."

# game/a1s5.rpy:734
translate spanish a1s5_fa2ece93:

    # "As I'm wondering all of this, I notice a shape in the bushes, near the ones that Alex and Neferu disappeared behind."
    "Mientras me pregunto todo esto, noto una figura entre los arbustos, cerca de aquellos detrás de los que desaparecieron Alex y Neferu."

# game/a1s5.rpy:735
translate spanish a1s5_ec0ddce1:

    # "Then I see a flash of red and maybe an elbow poking out."
    "Entonces veo un destello rojo y quizá un codo asomando."

# game/a1s5.rpy:736
translate spanish a1s5_9316a441:

    # m "\"What the—Amicus?\""
    m "\"Qué demonios—¿Amicus?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:737
translate spanish a1s5_b2467365:

    # "I yell out in his direction and I see the wolf jump, suddenly coming out from behind his cover."
    "Grito en su dirección y veo al lobo sobresaltarse y salir de repente de su escondite."

# game/a1s5.rpy:739
translate spanish a1s5_4807ec03:

    # a "\"Y—yes, was just having a look at the roses.\""
    a "\"S—sí, solo estaba mirando las rosas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:740
translate spanish a1s5_a34afdbe:

    # "The wolf walks toward me, his paws behind his back."
    "El lobo se acerca a mí con las patas detrás de la espalda."

# game/a1s5.rpy:741
translate spanish a1s5_83b2a1c1:

    # "I raise an eyebrow at him."
    "Le alzo una ceja."

# game/a1s5.rpy:742
translate spanish a1s5_03b3b1f0:

    # m "\"Were you spying on us? Were you trying to avoid Neferu, or something?\""
    m "\"¿Nos estabas espiando? ¿Intentabas evitar a Neferu o algo así?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:743
translate spanish a1s5_7fc1f32e:

    # "Amicus ignores me this time."
    "Esta vez Amicus me ignora."

# game/a1s5.rpy:745
translate spanish a1s5_6e5b7feb:

    # a "\"How was your day, [mc]?\""
    a "\"¿Qué tal tu día, [mc]?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:746
translate spanish a1s5_b9e3310e:

    # m "\"Umm...Okaaay.\""
    m "\"Ehh...bieeen.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:747
translate spanish a1s5_a0341c5e:

    # "I try to look around the wolf's side at whatever he's hiding behind his back, but he turns accordingly to keep it obscured."
    "Intento mirar alrededor del costado del lobo para ver lo que oculta detrás de la espalda, pero él gira para mantenerlo fuera de mi vista."

# game/a1s5.rpy:748
translate spanish a1s5_9e2304d6:

    # m "\"What are you doing?\""
    m "\"¿Qué estás haciendo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:749
translate spanish a1s5_0fb53a3f:

    # a "\"Well...\""
    a "\"Bueno...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:750
translate spanish a1s5_05a93913:

    # "Amicus takes a deep breath and I feel myself starting to get nervous."
    "Amicus respira hondo y noto que empiezo a ponerme nervioso."

# game/a1s5.rpy:751
translate spanish a1s5_aa9a4062:

    # "Then he goes down to one knee."
    "Entonces se arrodilla sobre una rodilla."

# game/a1s5.rpy:754
translate spanish a1s5_e914e437:

    # a "\"[mc], over the past few weeks I've come to enjoy your company immensely.\""
    a "\"[mc], durante estas últimas semanas he llegado a disfrutar inmensamente de tu compañía.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:755
translate spanish a1s5_a2f345f6:

    # "My mouth drops."
    "Se me abre la boca."

# game/a1s5.rpy:756
translate spanish a1s5_45ded5a4:

    # a "\"And over the past few weeks, I've come to realize that we share so much in common in terms of our goals and desires.\""
    a "\"Y durante estas últimas semanas he comprendido cuánto tenemos en común en nuestros objetivos y deseos.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:757
translate spanish a1s5_aceadc3b:

    # "Amicus gives me a coy smile at that."
    "Amicus me dedica una sonrisa tímidamente pícara."

# game/a1s5.rpy:758
translate spanish a1s5_fe3e2511:

    # m "\"What are you—\""
    m "\"Qué estás—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:759
translate spanish a1s5_312b7eaf:

    # a "\"So, I decided that I should take the next step, to make you feel more welcome and to show you how much I appreciate your kindness and understanding.\""
    a "\"Así que decidí dar el siguiente paso, hacer que te sientas más bienvenido y mostrarte cuánto aprecio tu amabilidad y comprensión.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:760
translate spanish a1s5_5b15d884:

    # "The wolf suddenly swings his paws to his front, revealing what he'd been hiding."
    "El lobo lleva de repente las patas al frente y revela lo que ocultaba."

# game/a1s5.rpy:761
translate spanish a1s5_acc44c0b:

    # "It's a bouquet of purple flowers, lavenders to be exact, along with several smaller white flowers sprinkled into the mix."
    "Es un ramo de flores moradas, lavandas para ser exactos, con varias flores blancas más pequeñas repartidas entre ellas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:763
translate spanish a1s5_3f932d51:

    # a "\"[mc], will you date me?\""
    a "\"[mc], ¿quieres salir conmigo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:765
translate spanish a1s5_cd29d082:

    # "I stare at the wolf, still taking in the presentation he'd just given me."
    "Miro fijamente al lobo, todavía asimilando la presentación que acaba de hacerme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:766
translate spanish a1s5_de5b0e1c:

    # "My mouth still hangs open and I make a few \"uh\" sounds as I try to form a coherent sentence to respond in my mind."
    "Sigo con la boca abierta y emito unos cuantos \"eh\" mientras intento formar mentalmente una respuesta coherente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:768
translate spanish a1s5_07af5409:

    # a "\"Ah, I probably messed that up, huh? Well, hopefully the message came across clearly? What do you think?\""
    a "\"Ah, probablemente lo hice mal, ¿no? Bueno, ¿espero que el mensaje haya quedado claro? ¿Qué piensas?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:769
translate spanish a1s5_c750b2ca:

    # m "\"I—I'm stunned.\""
    m "\"Yo—estoy atónito.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:771
translate spanish a1s5_70d3e4c1:

    # a "\"And that's...good?\""
    a "\"Y eso...¿es bueno?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:772
translate spanish a1s5_da607eba:

    # m "\"Amicus, what is this?\""
    m "\"Amicus, ¿qué es esto?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:774
translate spanish a1s5_3a29d2ae:

    # a "\"I did something wrong, didn't I?\""
    a "\"He hecho algo mal, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:775
translate spanish a1s5_f3aee734:

    # m "\"Well, I mean...did you mean to do it?\""
    m "\"Bueno, quiero decir...¿pretendías hacerlo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:776
translate spanish a1s5_64efc63a:

    # "The whole thing is crazy, but Amicus's demeanor doesn't really match with the proposal he'd just made."
    "Todo esto es una locura, pero la actitud de Amicus no encaja realmente con la propuesta que acaba de hacer."

# game/a1s5.rpy:777
translate spanish a1s5_52e07f74:

    # a "\"Did I mean to ask you out on a date?\""
    a "\"¿Si pretendía invitarte a una cita?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:778
translate spanish a1s5_a9ad7fed:

    # m "\"Well...yeah, did you?\""
    m "\"Bueno...sí, ¿era eso?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:779
translate spanish a1s5_8ca1d22f:

    # a "\"Yes?\""
    a "\"¿Sí?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:780
translate spanish a1s5_82660e3e:

    # "Now the wolf is really fidgeting, tugging at his cape nervously as he lowers the bouquet to hang limply at his side."
    "Ahora el lobo está realmente inquieto, tirando nerviosamente de su capa mientras deja el ramo colgando sin fuerza a su lado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:781
translate spanish a1s5_6b0a828b:

    # "I have an odd butterflies-in-the-stomach feeling that won't seem to go away."
    "Tengo una extraña sensación de mariposas en el estómago que no desaparece."

# game/a1s5.rpy:782
translate spanish a1s5_e1caa137:

    # "I don't know what it means, but I try to ignore it."
    "No sé qué significa, pero intento ignorarla."

# game/a1s5.rpy:783
translate spanish a1s5_c4dac397:

    # "The wolf suddenly deflates, looking dejected."
    "El lobo se desinfla de repente, abatido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:785
translate spanish a1s5_14094755:

    # a "\"Did I pick up the incorrect meaning?\""
    a "\"¿Entendí mal el significado?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:786
translate spanish a1s5_a15f46f9:

    # "I clear my throat, trying to gather my wits."
    "Me aclaro la garganta, intentando recuperar la lucidez."

# game/a1s5.rpy:787
translate spanish a1s5_ea1af301:

    # m "\"What, uh, do you think dating is?\""
    m "\"¿Qué, eh, crees que es salir con alguien?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:789
translate spanish a1s5_ef3d4fc8:

    # a "\"Well, what you told me; it's a relationship status that enables you to become closer, learn more about each other, along with normalizing physical intimacy.\""
    a "\"Bueno, lo que me dijiste: un estado de relación que permite acercarse, conocerse mejor y normalizar la intimidad física.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:790
translate spanish a1s5_4478e413:

    # "Well, he seems to have it down for the most part."
    "Bueno, parece haberlo entendido en su mayor parte."

# game/a1s5.rpy:791
translate spanish a1s5_c0312a65:

    # "The part that I'm having trouble with though..."
    "Pero la parte que me cuesta..."

# game/a1s5.rpy:792
translate spanish a1s5_c7eb1d6e:

    # m "\"Well, people that date also tend to have...I guess feelings for each other.\""
    m "\"Bueno, las personas que salen juntas también suelen tener...supongo que sentimientos la una por la otra.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:794
translate spanish a1s5_286d7dd3:

    # a "\"Well yes, I have very friendly feelings toward you, and I want to make you more comfortable around me, especially when it comes to physical intimacy. Isn't that the point of dating?\""
    a "\"Bueno, sí, siento mucha amistad por ti y quiero que estés más cómodo conmigo, especialmente con la intimidad física. ¿No es ese el propósito de salir juntos?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:795
translate spanish a1s5_5fd9a0e4:

    # "I sigh, realizing I hadn't explained it well enough, but then I hadn't realized that Amicus was planning to do this either."
    "Suspiro, comprendiendo que no lo expliqué suficientemente bien, aunque tampoco sabía que Amicus planeaba hacer esto."

# game/a1s5.rpy:796
translate spanish a1s5_7058fe6a:

    # m "\"Well, usually people don't do it unless they love each other...\""
    m "\"Bueno, normalmente la gente no lo hace a menos que se quiera...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:797
translate spanish a1s5_0756e718:

    # "My voice gets quieter and quieter over the course of the sentence until Amicus has to poke his ears forward to hear me."
    "Mi voz se vuelve cada vez más baja a lo largo de la frase, hasta que Amicus debe inclinar las orejas hacia delante para oírme."

# game/a1s5.rpy:798
translate spanish a1s5_0b24a914:

    # a "\"Love?\""
    a "\"¿Amor?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:799
translate spanish a1s5_6bff4e6b:

    # m "\"...Yeah.\""
    m "\"...Sí.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:801
translate spanish a1s5_69f0220c:

    # a "\"Oh.\""
    a "\"Ah.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:802
translate spanish a1s5_f5f2bbb5:

    # "Amicus stands there a moment before the insides of his ears turn bright red."
    "Amicus se queda quieto un momento antes de que el interior de sus orejas se vuelva rojo intenso."

# game/a1s5.rpy:806
translate spanish a1s5_e37fc829:

    # a "\"You said it was casual!\""
    a "\"¡Dijiste que era informal!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:807
translate spanish a1s5_d3b520ee:

    # "The wolf raises his voice, the sudden increase in volume making me jump."
    "El lobo alza la voz y el repentino aumento de volumen me sobresalta."

# game/a1s5.rpy:808
translate spanish a1s5_3fc5177b:

    # m "\"Well it is! I mean, you don't necessarily have to be {i}in love{/i} to date, but the intention is usually to {i}find{/i} love...\""
    m "\"¡Pues sí! Quiero decir, no hace falta estar {i}enamorado{/i} para salir con alguien, pero la intención suele ser {i}encontrar{/i} el amor...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:810
translate spanish a1s5_cdc16c3a:

    # a "\"Dear gods, was your intention just to humiliate me after the dance?\""
    a "\"Por los dioses, ¿solo pretendías humillarme después del baile?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:811
translate spanish a1s5_d6506fb9:

    # m "\"What the hell are you talking about? How was I supposed to know you were planning this?\""
    m "\"¿Qué demonios dices? ¿Cómo se supone que iba a saber que planeabas esto?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:813
translate spanish a1s5_00423455:

    # a "\"I think me asking those questions had made it fairly obvious.\""
    a "\"Creo que mis preguntas lo hacían bastante evidente.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:814
translate spanish a1s5_05a5113d:

    # m "\"You assume way too much.\""
    m "\"Das demasiadas cosas por hechas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:816
translate spanish a1s5_ed8e9401:

    # a "\"Clearly.\""
    a "\"Está claro.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:817
translate spanish a1s5_5c510239:

    # "The wolf tosses the bouquet to the side, letting it land on the bench before it rolls off to the ground."
    "El lobo arroja el ramo a un lado, dejándolo caer en el banco antes de que ruede hasta el suelo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:819
translate spanish a1s5_be2630fe:

    # "Amicus slumps onto the bench next to me, his ears still red."
    "Amicus se desploma en el banco a mi lado, con las orejas todavía rojas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:820
translate spanish a1s5_19eaca18:

    # "I let him grumble to himself for a minute or two, wanting to let him cool off from the initial embarrassment."
    "Lo dejo refunfuñar un minuto o dos, para que se le pase la vergüenza inicial."

# game/a1s5.rpy:821
translate spanish a1s5_f1a88c56:

    # "Then I reach up to rest a hand on his broad shoulder."
    "Después extiendo la mano y la apoyo en su ancho hombro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:822
translate spanish a1s5_413e69ef:

    # m "\"Sorry, I didn't mean to embarrass you. Besides, how were you supposed to know? It's an Earth thing.\""
    m "\"Perdona, no pretendía avergonzarte. Además, ¿cómo ibas a saberlo? Es una cosa de la Tierra.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:823
translate spanish a1s5_73f15cfa:

    # "Amicus waves a paw."
    "Amicus agita una pata."

# game/a1s5.rpy:826
translate spanish a1s5_6f08a5b2:

    # a "\"S'fine. Like you said, I assume too much.\""
    a "\"No pasa nada. Como dijiste, doy demasiadas cosas por hechas.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:827
translate spanish a1s5_4a38b0f7:

    # "I lean over to pick up the bouquet, seeing how the flowers just kind of looked bunched together."
    "Me inclino para recoger el ramo y veo cómo las flores simplemente parecen amontonadas."

# game/a1s5.rpy:828
translate spanish a1s5_5a6cff89:

    # m "\"You make this yourself?\""
    m "\"¿Lo hiciste tú?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:829
translate spanish a1s5_07baf5cc:

    # a "\"Well, yes. The garden has many flowers.\""
    a "\"Bueno, sí. El jardín tiene muchas flores.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:830
translate spanish a1s5_f7bd2aca:

    # m "\"It smells like you.\""
    m "\"Huele como tú.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:832
translate spanish a1s5_8e60af51:

    # a "\"Er, yes.\""
    a "\"Eh, sí.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:833
translate spanish a1s5_5b40bdb0:

    # m "\"It looks good.\""
    m "\"Tiene buen aspecto.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:835
translate spanish a1s5_38471715_1:

    # a "\"Thank you.\""
    a "\"Gracias.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:836
translate spanish a1s5_1ec2f81b:

    # "We sit quietly for a few more minutes as I pretend to examine all the flowers in the bouquet."
    "Nos quedamos callados unos minutos más mientras finjo examinar todas las flores del ramo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:837
translate spanish a1s5_13146426:

    # a "\"So...It's either friendship or love with humans? No physical intimacy unless you're bound to fall in love?\""
    a "\"Entonces...¿con los humanos es amistad o amor? ¿No hay intimidad física salvo que estéis destinados a enamoraros?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:838
translate spanish a1s5_9d3344cb:

    # m "\"What do you mean?\""
    m "\"¿Qué quieres decir?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:840
translate spanish a1s5_b4dae761:

    # a "\"Like this 'dating' culture you have. You were interested in giving me that sexual favor. Does that mean you're also interested in love with me as well?\""
    a "\"Esa cultura vuestra de 'salir juntos'. Querías hacerme aquel favor sexual. ¿Eso significa que también te interesa enamorarte de mí?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:841
translate spanish a1s5_a381710c:

    # "I blush."
    "Me sonrojo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:842
translate spanish a1s5_c5899eca:

    # m "\"Well, not exactly.\""
    m "\"Bueno, no exactamente.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:843
translate spanish a1s5_7e6a70cc:

    # a "\"Didn't you say dating allows for more intimacy? But dating is also meant to look for love?\""
    a "\"¿No dijiste que salir juntos permite más intimidad? ¿Pero también sirve para buscar el amor?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:844
translate spanish a1s5_7f776825:

    # "I sigh and set the bouquet aside."
    "Suspiro y aparto el ramo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:845
translate spanish a1s5_62deb1f7:

    # m "\"Things are changing, becoming more...casual.\""
    m "\"Las cosas están cambiando, volviéndose más...informales.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:847
translate spanish a1s5_3d01c8fb:

    # "I say the word carefully and Amicus snorts."
    "Digo la palabra con cuidado y Amicus resopla."

# game/a1s5.rpy:848
translate spanish a1s5_d9711857:

    # m "\"But I guess the term you might be looking for is 'friends with benefits'.\""
    m "\"Pero supongo que el término que buscas es 'amigos con derecho a roce'.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:849
translate spanish a1s5_fe8c4e90:

    # a "\"Benefits?\""
    a "\"¿Derecho a roce?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:850
translate spanish a1s5_2b8075ea:

    # m "\"Friends that have sex, basically.\""
    m "\"Amigos que tienen sexo, básicamente.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:852
translate spanish a1s5_6b247c2c:

    # a "\"Ah, I see. We haven't done that, though.\""
    a "\"Ah, ya veo. Aunque nosotros no lo hemos hecho.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:853
translate spanish a1s5_e8fffe1e:

    # m "\"No. But I'm not gonna make you date me just to get a hand-job.\""
    m "\"No. Pero no voy a obligarte a salir conmigo solo para masturbarte.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:855
translate spanish a1s5_0281ebdc:

    # a "\"Hehe...\""
    a "\"Je, je...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:857
translate spanish a1s5_24e64e73:

    # "Amicus scratches behind his head before looking away again."
    "Amicus se rasca detrás de la cabeza antes de volver a apartar la mirada."

# game/a1s5.rpy:858
translate spanish a1s5_02057283:

    # "Once again, I find myself feeling bad for him."
    "De nuevo, me da pena."

# game/a1s5.rpy:859
translate spanish a1s5_d1cd676e:

    # m "\"Listen, if we weren't having this whole—\""
    m "\"Escucha, si no estuviéramos con toda esta—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:860
translate spanish a1s5_3197c1c2:

    # "I lower my voice."
    "Bajo la voz."

# game/a1s5.rpy:861
translate spanish a1s5_1b58451d:

    # m "\"—illegal space adventure, I might say yes.\""
    m "\"—aventura espacial ilegal, quizá diría que sí.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:863
translate spanish a1s5_ea0f8f8b:

    # a "\"What, really?\""
    a "\"¿Qué, de verdad?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:864
translate spanish a1s5_d01da12b:

    # m "\"I said 'might'.\""
    m "\"He dicho 'podría'.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:866
translate spanish a1s5_313fcd7d:

    # a "\"Oh, really?\""
    a "\"¿Ah, de verdad?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:867
translate spanish a1s5_3a49b7ff:

    # m "\"I think you're missing a key word there.\""
    m "\"Creo que te estás saltando una palabra clave.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:868
translate spanish a1s5_5d65d906:

    # a "\"I think I understand.\""
    a "\"Creo que lo entiendo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:869
translate spanish a1s5_84fbcda7:

    # "I find myself turning red again, wishing I'd just kept my mouth shut."
    "Me pongo rojo otra vez, deseando haber mantenido la boca cerrada."

# game/a1s5.rpy:870
translate spanish a1s5_eb50d343:

    # a "\"Well, maybe I might as well.\""
    a "\"Bueno, quizá yo también.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:871
translate spanish a1s5_be629f99:

    # m "\"Well, you already asked.\""
    m "\"Bueno, tú ya me lo has pedido.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:872
translate spanish a1s5_216a51a1:

    # a "\"Without knowing the full meaning.\""
    a "\"Sin conocer todo el significado.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:873
translate spanish a1s5_6775398c:

    # "I try to think of something else to change the subject, knowing that my blush is clear as day to the wolf and that he's very much enjoying it."
    "Intento pensar en otra cosa para cambiar de tema; sé que el lobo ve mi sonrojo perfectamente y lo está disfrutando mucho."

# game/a1s5.rpy:874
translate spanish a1s5_8794f7f0:

    # m "\"Anyway, Alexios told me that Cassius was training under a rhetoric person, um...Markus Manliest, or something?\""
    m "\"En fin, Alexios me dijo que Cassius entrenaba con un retórico, eh...Markus Masculinísimo, o algo así.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:876
translate spanish a1s5_b5fb7a3a:

    # "Amicus suddenly frowns."
    "Amicus frunce el ceño de repente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:877
translate spanish a1s5_d2f0e1e1:

    # a "\"Marcus Manius, really?\""
    a "\"¿Marcus Manius, en serio?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:878
translate spanish a1s5_f8b5a36d:

    # m "\"I think that's what he said.\""
    m "\"Creo que eso dijo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:879
translate spanish a1s5_607cbcdb:

    # a "\"Damn.\""
    a "\"Maldición.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:880
translate spanish a1s5_31c13a0e:

    # "Amicus's tone is that of awe."
    "El tono de Amicus expresa asombro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:881
translate spanish a1s5_61335156:

    # m "\"Is that bad?\""
    m "\"¿Es malo?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:882
translate spanish a1s5_773b6a0d:

    # a "\"It's...simply surprising. He's the most famous Adastran rhetorician there is.\""
    a "\"Es...simplemente sorprendente. Es el retórico más famoso de Adastra.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:883
translate spanish a1s5_b5d935dd:

    # m "\"Should I be worried?\""
    m "\"¿Debería preocuparme?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:885
translate spanish a1s5_6c54715c:

    # a "\"No, in fact, now that you've told me I'm in much better shape. I now have an idea of what style he might use, so that will make it easier to counter his points.\""
    a "\"No; de hecho, ahora que me lo has dicho estoy mucho mejor preparado. Ya tengo una idea del estilo que podría usar, así que será más fácil contrarrestar sus argumentos.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:886
translate spanish a1s5_745f0138_1:

    # m "\"If you're sure...\""
    m "\"Si estás seguro...\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:888
translate spanish a1s5_a265b6db:

    # a "\"Of course! Now come to my room to help me practice, just to make extra certain I'll win.\""
    a "\"¡Por supuesto! Ahora ven a mi habitación para ayudarme a practicar, para asegurar aún más mi victoria.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:892
translate spanish a1s5_deabd5ac:

    # "We get up and walk back to the palace through the gardens, leaving the bouquet of flowers behind on the bench."
    "Nos levantamos y volvemos al palacio por los jardines, dejando el ramo de flores en el banco."

# game/a1s5.rpy:893
translate spanish a1s5_04c4dd9c:

    # "Amicus seems to have gotten over his embarrassment about the whole incident pretty quickly."
    "Amicus parece haber superado bastante rápido la vergüenza de todo el incidente."

# game/a1s5.rpy:894
translate spanish a1s5_17f82a13:

    # "It's just like him to be able to do that, actually"
    "En realidad, es muy propio de él poder hacer eso"

# game/a1s5.rpy:895
translate spanish a1s5_d3affd42:

    # "In fact, we're laughing and talking just as easily as we always have, the wolf nudging me every few minutes to punctuate something he says, each one causing me to stumble."
    "De hecho, reímos y hablamos con la facilidad de siempre; el lobo me da un empujoncito cada pocos minutos para enfatizar algo que dice, y cada uno me hace tropezar."

# game/a1s5.rpy:898
translate spanish a1s5_72a65b7d:

    # a "\"Anyway, Cass tends to stutter over his words in front of large crowds. Not much a rhetorician can do about that!\""
    a "\"En fin, Cass suele tartamudear ante grandes multitudes. ¡Poco puede hacer un retórico al respecto!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:900
translate spanish a1s5_6b2445df:

    # "The wolf reaches out a paw, pressing it to the black square."
    "El lobo extiende una pata y la presiona contra el cuadrado negro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:903
translate spanish a1s5_eebb2563:

    # a "\"Besides, what exactly is he—\""
    a "\"Además, qué es exactamente lo que—\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:905
translate spanish a1s5_f484922b:

    # "Amicus and I stare in surprise as Cassius stares back at us with what looks like even more surprise."
    "Amicus y yo miramos sorprendidos a Cassius, que nos devuelve la mirada con lo que parece todavía más sorpresa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:906
translate spanish a1s5_06fbc770:

    # "Then his eyes narrow."
    "Entonces entrecierra los ojos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:908
translate spanish a1s5_e0a89ae0:

    # c "\"Excuse me.\""
    c "\"Con permiso.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:909
translate spanish a1s5_7c66e91a:

    # "He tries to move around us, but Amicus blocks his way, growling."
    "Intenta pasar a nuestro alrededor, pero Amicus le bloquea el camino, gruñendo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:911
translate spanish a1s5_6275a81a:

    # a "\"What the HELL are you doing in here, Cassius!\""
    a "\"¡Qué DEMONIOS haces aquí, Cassius!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:913
translate spanish a1s5_bdef24b7:

    # "Amicus seems to reserve his actual yelling only for Cassius, so it makes me jump when I hear it."
    "Amicus parece reservar los verdaderos gritos para Cassius, así que me sobresalto al oírlo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:914
translate spanish a1s5_e0f556f4:

    # "Cassius collects himself quickly despite Amicus's intimidating snarls."
    "Cassius se recompone rápidamente a pesar de los intimidantes gruñidos de Amicus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:916
translate spanish a1s5_e0162d1c:

    # c "\"Not much of your business, is it?\""
    c "\"No es asunto tuyo, ¿verdad?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:917
translate spanish a1s5_3b292880:

    # a "\"If you're in my room then it is my business.\""
    a "\"Si estás en mi habitación, sí es asunto mío.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:918
translate spanish a1s5_5fbbe62e:

    # a "\"What. Are. You. DOING!?\""
    a "\"¿¡Qué. Estás. HACIENDO!?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:920
translate spanish a1s5_a5c4e2bc:

    # "The wolf starts to advance on Cassius, stopping just feet away."
    "El lobo avanza hacia Cassius y se detiene a poca distancia."

# game/a1s5.rpy:922
translate spanish a1s5_07102c9f:

    # c "\"Move Amicus, otherwise I'm calling Cato.\""
    c "\"Apártate, Amicus, o llamaré a Cato.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:923
translate spanish a1s5_4ff680d1:

    # "Amicus eyes Cassius closely, then finally pulls back, folding his arms."
    "Amicus observa atentamente a Cassius y por fin retrocede, cruzándose de brazos."

# game/a1s5.rpy:925
translate spanish a1s5_9e5a3828:

    # a "\"Snooping around to find something that might give you a chance in the trial? I can tell you now that you'll be coming up short.\""
    a "\"¿Husmeando para encontrar algo que te dé una oportunidad en la prueba? Ya puedo decirte que no encontrarás nada.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:926
translate spanish a1s5_344041d5:

    # c "\"Obviously. You've nothing to offer to help me win.\""
    c "\"Evidentemente. No tienes nada que ofrecer para ayudarme a ganar.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:928
translate spanish a1s5_43b88e8e:

    # a "\"Then why come here?\""
    a "\"Entonces, ¿por qué venir aquí?\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:929
translate spanish a1s5_cb5fd7d8:

    # "Cassius ignores the other wolf, walking past Amicus before passing by me."
    "Cassius ignora al otro lobo, pasa junto a Amicus y después a mi lado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:930
translate spanish a1s5_bf84acde:

    # "He turns then."
    "Entonces se vuelve."

# game/a1s5.rpy:932
translate spanish a1s5_3db6cebb:

    # c "\"And you know, I shouldn't be worried after the pitiable display you and your 'pet' put on.\""
    c "\"Y, sabes, no debería preocuparme después de la lamentable exhibición que habéis dado tú y tu 'mascota'.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:933
translate spanish a1s5_2149161e:

    # "He turns to me and I can't help but frown at him."
    "Se vuelve hacia mí y no puedo evitar fruncirle el ceño."

# game/a1s5.rpy:934
translate spanish a1s5_3a3a6a36:

    # c "\"As stupid as he is ugly.\""
    c "\"Tan estúpido como feo.\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:935
translate spanish a1s5_e48b2e23:

    # "I know that Cassius is just trying to get under Amicus's skin."
    "Sé que Cassius solo intenta irritar a Amicus."

# game/a1s5.rpy:936
translate spanish a1s5_6bc6481f:

    # "He knows that he cares about me."
    "Sabe que le importo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:937
translate spanish a1s5_a408d1aa:

    # "But as Cassius reaches out to brush my chin with a paw, I can't stop myself from batting it away."
    "Pero cuando Cassius extiende una pata para rozarme la barbilla, no puedo evitar apartársela de un manotazo."

# game/a1s5.rpy:939
translate spanish a1s5_3a388d08:

    # "Cassius's eyes widen then, and I see his paw draw back."
    "Los ojos de Cassius se abren y veo su pata retirarse para golpear."

# game/a1s5.rpy:941
translate spanish a1s5_f86a34a9:

    # "I flinch, but immediately Amicus is there, reaching out to grab Cassius by his cape."
    "Me encojo, pero Amicus aparece inmediatamente y agarra a Cassius por la capa."

# game/a1s5.rpy:946
translate spanish a1s5_d8f14b87:

    # "The smaller wolf is pulled back from me, but Amicus doesn't stop there."
    "Aparta de mí al lobo más pequeño, pero Amicus no se detiene ahí."

# game/a1s5.rpy:947
translate spanish a1s5_f9419c16:

    # "As Cassius stumbles past Amicus, the bigger wolf swings his paw, smacking Cassius square in the nose."
    "Mientras Cassius pasa tambaleándose, Amicus lanza su pata y le da de lleno en la nariz."

# game/a1s5.rpy:949
translate spanish a1s5_1fba65db:

    # "Cassius immediately goes down on his ass at which point I hear another sound."
    "Cassius cae inmediatamente de culo, y entonces oigo otro sonido."

# game/a1s5.rpy:951
translate spanish a1s5_114d116f:

    # "Amicus and I stare down at the smaller wolf as he sits there, stunned, then he suddenly scrambles up to his feet, a paw to his rear."
    "Amicus y yo miramos al lobo más pequeño, que está sentado y aturdido; de repente se levanta a toda prisa, con una pata en el trasero."

# game/a1s5.rpy:953
translate spanish a1s5_f3011b69:

    # c "\"Amicus, you bastard! Tail-raising lover of ASS!\""
    c "\"¡Amicus, bastardo! ¡Levanta-colas amante del CULO!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:954
translate spanish a1s5_1258c9ce:

    # "I take a step back as Cassius practically sprays blood from his mouth."
    "Retrocedo un paso mientras Cassius casi escupe sangre a chorros."

# game/a1s5.rpy:956
translate spanish a1s5_3e25c4fe:

    # "Amicus pulls me to his side, eyes narrowed, but I can feel his heart hammering against my shoulder."
    "Amicus me atrae a su lado, con los ojos entrecerrados, pero siento su corazón martillear contra mi hombro."

# game/a1s5.rpy:957
translate spanish a1s5_afc7a7eb:

    # c "\"I'll throw you both in the dungeon for that. I'll have him EXECUTED when I'm emperor!\""
    c "\"Os meteré a los dos en la mazmorra por esto. ¡Mandaré EJECUTARLO cuando sea emperador!\""

# game/a1s5.rpy:959
translate spanish a1s5_c9eb4b7e:

    # "I see tears start to spill out of Cassius's eyes before he turns and stumbles out of the room, his tail hanging limply to the side."
    "Veo las lágrimas empezar a salir de los ojos de Cassius antes de que se vuelva y salga tambaleándose de la habitación, con la cola colgando sin fuerza a un lado."

# game/a1s5.rpy:961
translate spanish a1s5_56de8bf1:

    # "Amicus and I stand there for a long time after he leaves, the silence almost oppressive after the loud fight."
    "Amicus y yo permanecemos de pie un buen rato tras su partida; el silencio resulta casi opresivo después de la ruidosa pelea."

# game/a1s5.rpy:967
translate spanish a1s5_fec97169:

    # "To be continued..."
    "Continuará..."

translate spanish strings:

    # a1s5.rpy:48
    old "I don't know."
    new "No lo sé."

